ub.com/repos/enyineer/checkstack/commits/56e5375d8a9428ad9203426935a22d2315e241c4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27201677?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/enyineer","id":27201677,"login":"enyineer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjAxNjc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enyineer/checkstack/commits/5852a820265ee31a45811b1a42fa58dac29f38c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T02:07:41Z","email":"nico.enking@gmail.com","name":"Nico"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T02:07:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(ci): cache Git LFS in build jobs + drop tracked Playwright artifacts (#492)\n\nLFS is pulled only in the 4 build-related checkouts (deploy-docs, release, and\npr-checks'' e2e_build + security image build), but each re-downloaded the whole\n~3-4 MB LFS store from GitHub''s LFS bandwidth quota every run (2x/PR + releases).\n\n- Add a reusable `.github/actions/lfs-cache` composite: after `actions/checkout`\n  with `lfs: false`, restore an LFS object cache and `git lfs pull` only the\n  delta. A cache hit costs zero LFS bandwidth; a changed image costs just its own\n  delta. Wire it into all 4 build checkouts.\n- Remove `core/auth-frontend/playwright-report/` and `test-results/` from git -\n  accidental e2e output (already gitignored) that was even bloating LFS with two\n  screenshot PNGs.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KiVAPXAuVtVemtYvvyPXzp\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2c7c31f054c60342680602f293a688a42ba79785","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enyineer/checkstack/git/trees/2c7c31f054c60342680602f293a688a42ba79785"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enyineer/checkstack/git/commits/5852a820265ee31a45811b1a42fa58dac29f38c5","verification":{"payload":"tree 2c7c31f054c60342680602f293a688a42ba79785\nparent c83d2d7713aa1df9ea9622674222d80dc59b5647\nauthor Nico <nico.enking@gmail.com> 1785031661 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785031661 +0200\n\nchore(ci): cache Git LFS in build jobs + drop tracked Playwright artifacts (#492)\n\nLFS is pulled only in the 4 build-related checkouts (deploy-docs, release, and\npr-checks'' e2e_build + security image build), but each re-downloaded the whole\n~3-4 MB LFS store from GitHub''s LFS bandwidth quota every run (2x/PR + releases).\n\n- Add a reusable `.github/actions/lfs-cache` composite: after `actions/checkout`\n  with `lfs: false`, restore an LFS object cache and `git lfs pull` only the\n  delta. A cache hit costs zero LFS bandwidth; a changed image costs just its own\n  delta. Wire it into all 4 build checkouts.\n- Remove `core/auth-frontend/playwright-report/` and `test-results/` from git -\n  accidental e2e output (already gitignored) that was even bloating LFS with two\n  screenshot PNGs.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KiVAPXAuVtVemtYvvyPXzp\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZWvtCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAosEQAFcHZkY4Xxyt+mqub9Vz1PXd\n39DIWq8S99X4ebhbda0aoVHOR2zjD1vDBlHZoQEi+HjOUkszZ0Vko9thRrRDkJi+\nSQk5CSEgIJPJbCX5QNJNS