,"parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/enyineer/checkstack/commit/577ace5876a40dd2168aa8b032c8489509bc3386","sha":"577ace5876a40dd2168aa8b032c8489509bc3386","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enyineer/checkstack/commits/577ace5876a40dd2168aa8b032c8489509bc3386"}],"sha":"6d8bf2332ca2cfb5c5ba461343d39b07bc42222a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enyineer/checkstack/commits/6d8bf2332ca2cfb5c5ba461343d39b07bc42222a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27201677?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/enyineer","id":27201677,"login":"enyineer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjAxNjc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enyineer/checkstack/commits/577ace5876a40dd2168aa8b032c8489509bc3386/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T19:39:52Z","email":"nico.enking@gmail.com","name":"Nico"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T19:39:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(ci): bulletproof automerge for lock-file-maintenance PRs (#437)\n\nEnable Renovate automerge for the lock-file-maintenance PR, gated so it can\nonly merge when CI is green AND the release-triggering changeset is provably\ncorrect. Pairs with a branch-protection ruleset split (applied separately) that\nlets the Renovate app bypass ONLY the review requirement, never the status\nchecks.\n\n- renovate.json: automerge + platformAutomerge (GitHub-native, merges the\n  instant checks pass rather than on Mend''s slow cadence) + squash strategy on\n  lockFileMaintenance.\n- renovate-changeset.ts: add `--check` mode (plus pure `expectedChangeset` /\n  `checkChangeset` helpers). It regenerates the changeset from the lockfiles and\n  fails if the committed one is missing, stale, or drifted.\n- pr-checks.yml: run that `--check` inside the `deps` job for\n  renovate/lock-file-maintenance PRs, so it feeds the required `Report` check.\n  This closes the one silent hole: without it, a failed changeset generation\n  would let a patched lockfile automerge without ever triggering a release, so\n  the fix would sit in main unshipped. HEAD_REF/BASE_REF passed via env, never\n  interpolated into the shell.\n\nVerified on the real #434 lockfile diff: --check FAILS on a missing changeset\nand on a tampered one, PASSES on a correct one. 26 unit tests.\n\nNo changeset: CI/tooling-only change.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Gj1eu1Q46UAZT3Z79K2E1N\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1bef7d1746c4c36a6722f132031d2640d5098ac5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enyineer/checkstack/git/trees/1bef7d1746c4c36a6722f132031d2640d5098ac5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enyineer/checkstack/git/commits/577ace5876a40dd2168aa8b032c8489509bc3386","verification":{"payload":"tree 1bef7d1746c4c36a6722f132031d2640d5098ac5\nparent a91a1a8d00e0546d2e73e59b8b769e86877d94d3\nauthor Nico <nico.enking@gmail.com> 1783798792 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783798792 +0200\n\nfeat(ci): bulletproof automerge for lock-file-maintenance PRs (#437)\n\nEnable Renovate automerge for the lock-file-maintenance PR, gated so it can\nonly merge when CI is green AND the release-triggering changeset is provably\ncorrect. Pairs with a branch-protection ruleset split (applied separately) that\nlets the Renovate app bypass ONLY the review requirement, never the status\nchecks.\n\n- renovate.json: automerge + platformAutomerge (GitHub-native, merges the\n  instant checks pass rather than on Mend''s slow cadence) + squash strategy on\n  lockFileMaintenance.\n- renovate-changeset.ts: add `--check` mode (plus pure `expectedChangeset` /\n  `checkChangeset` helpers). It regenerates the changeset from the lockfiles and\n  fails if the committed one is missing, stale, or drifted.\n- pr-checks.yml: run that `--check` inside the `deps` job for\n  renovate/lock-file-maintenance PRs, so it feeds the required `Report` check.\n  This closes the one silent hole: without it, a failed changeset generation\n  would let a patched lockfile automerge without ever triggering a release, so\n  the fix would sit in main unshipped. HEAD_REF/BASE_REF passed via env, never\n  interpolated into the shell.\n\nVerified on the real #434 lockfile diff: --check FAILS on a missing changeset\nand on a tampered one, PASSES on a correct one. 26 unit tests.\n\nNo changeset: CI/tooling-only change.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Gj1eu1Q46UAZT3Z79K2E1N\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqUpwICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAM9kQAAGZgCxLKEWrbFmr4JdmzFLE\nbf19kJDjYl7/AOnJ/dTanVXIpuReJRt/Od7XDMSBbl4cS9YrYK+YUeqjn8LBBIlj\nZaIKxN7IyM9eH20jc/ovfK3oV2fwJcoqKVGk2oTEy+udSc+EanWROH/bSXO1adSU\nnyPcvhDOESkZFQHTZWoSUdlcmNxqz4oGTlUIeQv/KMnwQP1eiA74F0cDJNDhJMIZ\n5e1ec+NWxyLFpoF7z1i/r7MEnww/9vAHxflpx9mCArZqI/dc5KDhtk1JyA2A9ZPv\nnyk3+l6pDwl+IMtdW3wog4C9UnQIak5dIvcVXfnJC3UmptUDDywpCzPXik8KDbyU\nefUyfxOy2LgtOx8E0DvMMqVtkmkOrVdg0mWKtnWa77bMTyzxDRkPXIKtVQDLd0k6\nITE598rLPilEoXLzPYNCYUpEVD21iIZmaDQabiX1Baol6/EwO4iKJFd1jlnkYmnT\nydfeFzYFn91JmxChUN/nRgLEEcAyQfjsSq6ufJKC91eXq7RxYtdtsiFfxp48RLKP\n7vEIreRYSgdi/y1MLdlNWNvETAbO10bMPOEwFTNFc2LGz/5y0BI9bxB2oH55N