/api.github.com/users/enyineer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/enyineer","id":27201677,"login":"enyineer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjAxNjc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enyineer/checkstack/commits/b18ddcaa45a61368ad53b87fa8bdb36b904733c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T09:03:55Z","email":"nico.enking@gmail.com","name":"Nico"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T09:03:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ci): exclude stamped @checkstack/sdk from generated changeset (#435)\n\nThe lock-file-maintenance changeset generator attributed changed transitive\ndeps to every PUBLIC workspace package that declares them - including\n@checkstack/sdk. But @checkstack/sdk''s version is stamped from\n@checkstack/release and must never appear in a changeset (plan §7.3), so\n`generate:sdk:check` failed on the first real Renovate PR (#434):\n\n  ❌ A pending changeset references @checkstack/sdk ... MUST NOT appear\n\n@checkstack/sdk is published (not private), so the isPublic filter did not\ncatch it. Add an explicit CHANGESET_STAMPED_PACKAGES exclusion\n({@checkstack/sdk, @checkstack/release}) applied in owningWorkspaces, with a\nregression test. Verified against #434''s real lockfile diff: sdk is now\nexcluded (97 owners, down from 98).\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Gj1eu1Q46UAZT3Z79K2E1N\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3218067b423169fc06622ebba2176a9dcbe8b3d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enyineer/checkstack/git/trees/3218067b423169fc06622ebba2176a9dcbe8b3d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enyineer/checkstack/git/commits/b18ddcaa45a61368ad53b87fa8bdb36b904733c6","verification":{"payload":"tree 3218067b423169fc06622ebba2176a9dcbe8b3d1\nparent e429b382951664f93aa2f25928cf66ba412482ab\nauthor Nico <nico.enking@gmail.com> 1783760635 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783760635 +0200\n\nfix(ci): exclude stamped @checkstack/sdk from generated changeset (#435)\n\nThe lock-file-maintenance changeset generator attributed changed transitive\ndeps to every PUBLIC workspace package that declares them - including\n@checkstack/sdk. But @checkstack/sdk''s version is stamped from\n@checkstack/release and must never appear in a changeset (plan §7.3), so\n`generate:sdk:check` failed on the first real Renovate PR (#434):\n\n  ❌ A pending changeset references @checkstack/sdk ... MUST NOT appear\n\n@checkstack/sdk is published (not private), so the isPublic filter did not\ncatch it. Add an explicit CHANGESET_STAMPED_PACKAGES exclusion\n({@checkstack/sdk, @checkstack/release}) applied in owningWorkspaces, with a\nregression test. Verified against #434''s real lockfile diff: sdk is now\nexcluded (97 owners, down from 98).\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Gj1eu1Q46UAZT3Z79K2E1N\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqUgb7CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGXYQAHQjFamyuTwYcQfSWEzTPVGX\nQg7ErHMB6diXSqihgSddavSKscVQPLH8lgjXBY2ddGwSKtQm4XvQzg3QyyIL7hBQ\nSpVMj07DE/5EJMTSGTds7LvDWHn4kFq8BHzFPq6fQexcr9FXx+EL+g6efqEb1Eu3\nITWB9QTUOeobyFgH2fHn67XdIg5dWQI3vZP40IYtRFOCLRN5/TBIZT6W20SlGJnk\nX5Ek1UE5B+fcxOWLNNs7Sl0tVsizPSoGNniu2