/api.github.com/repos/enyineer/checkstack/commits/b18ddcaa45a61368ad53b87fa8bdb36b904733c6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27201677?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/enyineer","id":27201677,"login":"enyineer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjAxNjc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enyineer/checkstack/commits/e429b382951664f93aa2f25928cf66ba412482ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T08:42:33Z","email":"nico.enking@gmail.com","name":"Nico"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T08:42:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ci): run lockFileMaintenance at any time, not a 4h window (#433)\n\nThe `before 4am` window coupled PR creation to Mend executing a Renovate run\ninside that 4-hour band. Mend''s hosted cadence is unpredictable (an idle repo\nsaw a ~9h gap overnight), so the window was missed and no lock-file PR was ever\ncreated. Set the schedule to `at any time` so the PR appears on the next Mend\nrun regardless of hour. This is not noisy: lockFileMaintenance only creates or\nrefreshes the single PR when the regenerated lockfile actually changes, and the\nbunfig.toml minimumReleaseAge cooldown gates which versions are eligible.\n\nNote: the schedule is set explicitly rather than removed, because omitting it\nreverts to lockFileMaintenance''s built-in weekly default (`before 4am on\nmonday`), which is more restrictive. Validated with renovate-config-validator.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Gj1eu1Q46UAZT3Z79K2E1N\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2a9eea209262bb9a5e6fc5cab4c54b3ab84c24a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enyineer/checkstack/git/trees/2a9eea209262bb9a5e6fc5cab4c54b3ab84c24a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enyineer/checkstack/git/commits/e429b382951664f93aa2f25928cf66ba412482ab","verification":{"payload":"tree 2a9eea209262bb9a5e6fc5cab4c54b3ab84c24a9\nparent 069235aa5dc669bdf94b674a8cf9add498fbcb12\nauthor Nico <nico.enking@gmail.com> 1783759353 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783759353 +0200\n\nfix(ci): run lockFileMaintenance at any time, not a 4h window (#433)\n\nThe `before 4am` window coupled PR creation to Mend executing a Renovate run\ninside that 4-hour band. Mend''s hosted cadence is unpredictable (an idle repo\nsaw a ~9h gap overnight), so the window was missed and no lock-file PR was ever\ncreated. Set the schedule to `at any time` so the PR appears on the next Mend\nrun regardless of hour. This is not noisy: lockFileMaintenance only creates or\nrefreshes the single PR when the regenerated lockfile actually changes, and the\nbunfig.toml minimumReleaseAge cooldown gates which versions are eligible.\n\nNote: the schedule is set explicitly rather than removed, because omitting it\nreverts to lockFileMaintenance''s built-in weekly default (`before 4am on\nmonday`), which is more restrictive. Validated with renovate-config-validator.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Gj1eu1Q46UAZT3Z79K2E1N\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqUgH5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYZgQAALVzHMVhDc4LK