tle` is not\nnestable there either. The PR title now comes from the valid\n`commitMessageAction` + `commitMessageTopic`. Validated with\n`renovate-config-validator`.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Gj1eu1Q46UAZT3Z79K2E1N\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"91821242d4ddafa410b516eea1268d102ba2dc84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enyineer/checkstack/git/trees/91821242d4ddafa410b516eea1268d102ba2dc84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enyineer/checkstack/git/commits/069235aa5dc669bdf94b674a8cf9add498fbcb12","verification":{"payload":"tree 91821242d4ddafa410b516eea1268d102ba2dc84\nparent d9f2771bd54326dc6631e40b683db9b27c69aee7\nauthor Nico <nico.enking@gmail.com> 1783724063 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783724063 +0200\n\nfix(ci): drop invalid lockFileMaintenance options from renovate.json (#431)\n\nRenovate rejected the whole config with \"Invalid configuration option:\nlockFileMaintenance.prBodyDefinition\", so it never ran (no dashboard, no PR).\n`prBodyDefinition` is a repository-level option that cannot be nested inside\n`lockFileMaintenance` (its value was the default anyway), and `prTitle` is not\nnestable there either. The PR title now comes from the valid\n`commitMessageAction` + `commitMessageTopic`. Validated with\n`renovate-config-validator`.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Gj1eu1Q46UAZT3Z79K2E1N\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqUXgfCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQRwQADDFMFo4zzNzxaiEMtJGCO3I\nlBAi0dULf3G5U+HQPiWAQU0/x9VPxaInvPncImzN5NWuIJakpPjZuRy4/yANeN/Q\n1Rtj51Of3M7GnF2lGyoUgTWBLgo/s+jk5FAaVu2uNDPueKbEX2zgmSTeD9G8gmA/\nBJqm2jHfM3ynRs/5G8QFyDUzFYmePvMckhodC2rmDsL7xScazYHUUrm6df2i7S9F\nVa/G7LX15uNNIo4vNkfOz4NhiGxlQ33mzqTdlK82HimbnTEcIbVTSiGnZGnfW7ml\nKwhYw9EP1k4ikTZ/j/LI7F1kHFhT5IiHRohgw6yjhPITGeRuUV33xVmsh1Z7VG6l\niOY/GynoItSPnKfkLLFRu73qRXmW4UFFdihdt3F7ztEMwRK