ercontent.com/u/27201677?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/enyineer","id":27201677,"login":"enyineer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjAxNjc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/enyineer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enyineer/checkstack/commits/d9f2771bd54326dc6631e40b683db9b27c69aee7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T22:49:15Z","email":"nico.enking@gmail.com","name":"Nico"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T22:49:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(security): daily bun.lock maintenance via Renovate + PR dep gate (#428)\n\nKeep the dependency graph patched on a schedule instead of relying on a\nscanner''s advisory feed. Trivy resolves npm CVEs from the GitHub Advisory\nDatabase, so an NVD-published CVE with no GHSA entry (e.g. the node-tar /\nfast-uri / brace-expansion advisories that shipped in 0.130.0) is invisible to\nCI until GHSA backfills. Refreshing bun.lock within the existing semver ranges\nfixes those before anyone maps them.\n\nRenovate:\n- renovate.json enables lockFileMaintenance daily (one long-lived PR,\n  rebased against main) and disables all ordinary version-bump updates -\n  package.json ranges stay hand-curated, transitive pins stay in\n  security/managed-overrides.json.\n- bunfig.toml adds a 3-day minimumReleaseAge supply-chain cooldown. This is\n  the only place it can live: Renovate''s own cooldown does not apply to\n  lockFileMaintenance and bun has no --before flag, so bun enforces it on the\n  bare `bun install` Renovate runs. packageManager pins bun so an older bun\n  cannot ignore the key silently.\n- renovate-changeset.yml + scripts/renovate-changeset.ts attribute each\n  changed transitive dep to its nearest PUBLIC workspace ancestors (via a\n  prod edge) and write one idempotent changeset, so the lockfile-only PR\n  actually triggers a release and rebuilds the production image. Private\n  packages and dev-only edges are excluded.\n\nPR-time security gates (pr-checks.yml):\n- New security_deps job scans the whole npm graph incl. devDependencies from\n  bun.lock BEFORE any installing job runs; all eight installing jobs need it,\n  so a fixable dev-dep CVE never executes in a job holding GITHUB_TOKEN.\n- The existing image scan is restricted to the container/OS layer\n  (TRIVY_PKG_TYPES=os) and runs in parallel - the npm graph is already a\n  superset covered by security_deps, and its build is Docker-isolated.\n- Both gate on an upgrade path (a fixed version exists) and only warn\n  otherwise. report aggregates security_deps independently so a skipped\n  installing job cannot false-green.\n- audit-trivy.ts mirrors the split (fs = --include-dev-deps, image =\n  --pkg-types os) so the local reproduce commands match CI.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Gj1eu1Q46UAZT3Z79K2E1N\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0c8d43a9f0270955a3d272ed3af07299fd23788a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enyineer/checkstack/git/trees/0c8d43a9f0270955a3d272ed3af07299fd23788a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enyineer/checkstack/git/commits/d9f2771bd54326dc6631e40b683db9b27c69aee7","verification":{"payload":"tree 0c8d43a9f0270955a3d272ed3af07299fd23788a\nparent 509aac84577bb8d0c5a8f46af1fbceca430b1e78\nauthor Nico <nico.enking@gmail.com> 1783723755 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783723755 +0200\n\nchore(security): daily bun.lock maintenance via Renovate + PR dep gate (#428)\n\nKeep the dependency graph patched on a schedule instead of relying on a\nscanner''s advisory feed. Trivy resolves npm CVEs from the GitHub Advisory\nDatabase, so an NVD-published CVE with no GHSA entry (e.g. the node-tar /\nfast-uri / brace-expansion advisories that shipped in 0.130.0) is invisible to\nCI until GHSA backfills. Refreshing bun.lock within the existing semver ranges\nfixes those before anyone maps them.\n\nRenovate:\n- renovate.json enables lockFileMaintenance daily (one long-lived PR,\n  rebased against main) and disables all ordinary version-bump updates -\n  package.json ranges stay hand-curated, transitive pins stay in\n  security/managed-overrides.json.\n- bunfig.toml adds a 3-day minimumReleaseAge supply-chain cooldown. This is\n  the only place it can live: Renovate''s own cooldown does not apply to\n  lockFileMaintenance and bun has no --before flag, so bun enforces it on the\n  bare `bun install` Renovate runs. packageManager pins bun so an older bun\n  cannot ignore the key silently.\n- renovate-changeset.yml + scripts/renovate-changeset.ts attribute each\n  changed transitive dep to its nearest PUBLIC workspace ancestors (via a\n  prod edge) and write one idempotent changeset, so the lockfile-only PR\n  actually triggers a release and rebuilds the production image. Private\n  packages and dev-only edges are excluded.\n\nPR-time security gates (pr-checks.yml):\n- New security_deps job scans the whole npm graph incl. devDependencies from\n  bun.lock BEFORE any installing job runs; all eight installing jobs need it,\n  so a fixable dev-dep CVE never executes in a job holding GITHUB_TOKEN.\n- The existing image scan is restricted to the container/OS layer\n  (TRIVY_PKG_TYPES=os) and runs in parallel - the npm graph is already a\n  superset covered by security_deps, and its build is Docker-isolated.\n- Both gate on an upgrade path (a fixed version exists) and only warn\n  otherwise. report aggregates security_deps independently so a skipped\n  installing job cannot false-green.\n- audit-trivy.ts mirrors the split (fs = --include-dev-deps, image =\n  --pkg-types os) so the local reproduce commands match CI.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Gj1eu1Q46UAZT3Z79K2E1N\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqUXbrCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALXYQAFtnLnUgK9wQqncn1/waor8q\nhXKJy4aqOu9Gva3kARtxOLmRHlwLm/gF6n1LaO8ewBeJJ+SNOasbqNu+iPU8nK1X\n5k230P0Ay8LJOo3XxyfiKtvrXaqkigCw0U0uycdQMR3jqhvzPz1+lwon5Lv1tpIx\ntjeHRx1sVI8h2FltXDzrIXOxvXZG/7WTaUEe0e2g7Kvh5z2lSdK+0GOuGEt7I0j6\nNUp/ckAgDKn7ma2Ln7DkjAG6v0CO9K7dGng5mjzo2m4RR6B5B74LU4uar7Ftzz53\nP6BtE+cC7zUmIfxdJHjOGAJ88n9++r7WXM+YYvzlswQ3T0E0oiuqaA0HVlBfqHzK\nutAnH/nMbQ7laCiYjSBLtQwBktMIuH+IwMCXYSdxrnV3gRxqOTx3vCcpa6CoU6Ya\niJoBfxzUqz26S+K9SCRfv9dqIqL8T/IzdRgExB5taUPUKtg1HLCbPFE8BXXu1dpn\nauTKM9eZYx0TN15PRfEK9WasvMFupvWuA+tWJT6XEz7tReaCrwJaqqUqEcTjweSN\nWdxxUHbmNLg87NMWp6BVMehE0zC7uxPOdu6RJBGjDdm679ghBE3ow64Ea9JJqNhn\nvhhiTitpNyzQlyJ4z1E9GrA819Z1ZpYChcAsbq/jNSbFGvG62Uq5MNwaMblIXNNe\ng6ng8X0zu5phuJNcoUZU\n=/Evz\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-10T22:49:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api