utout to @stuajnht in the changelog entries for the container\nhealth-check, incident health-override, and shared DataTable features, whose\nfeedback shaped them. The default changesets changelog inlines each changeset\nbody verbatim, so the credit lands in each package''s CHANGELOG on release.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014tB8vZmB9gDDpf285XoeLy\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8018f4f7c899f5cbb21bcd1a9fbcfc0106443c76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enyineer/checkstack/git/trees/8018f4f7c899f5cbb21bcd1a9fbcfc0106443c76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enyineer/checkstack/git/commits/8d3110ea0596c3434cc1d330493dc03dfdefbc14","verification":{"payload":"tree 8018f4f7c899f5cbb21bcd1a9fbcfc0106443c76\nparent fc64fad46a1ad80d03e1c6601bc474f06570e16b\nauthor Nico <nico.enking@gmail.com> 1783347378 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783347378 +0200\n\ndocs(changeset): credit @stuajnht for release feedback (#414)\n\nAdd a shoutout to @stuajnht in the changelog entries for the container\nhealth-check, incident health-override, and shared DataTable features, whose\nfeedback shaped them. The default changesets changelog inlines each changeset\nbody verbatim, so the credit lands in each package''s CHANGELOG on release.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014tB8vZmB9gDDpf285XoeLy\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqS7iyCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADaUQADNZiXgTy6+Vfsz6yL5pD4L3\ntlspHdRU3kiIjS1/w9I0bpv/6NcuMyvsLpy/c4jrphW1Bb9xEJ0tHARAbrYYk1dC\n67sMS+1+kvQbtnP2IplD5NPKyS1nrEvzxfaVvBgtA9RnmWpYp5zXpVEK3QVG3CWr\ngO7CaRPJ3FiR0Uek0vK3W0SvItdWq29useryl88/VaqktZdWgSOym8mmAYe4v5WV\nfNdWCz6qmzbLvplGto6rjQk06QLyei00tz+qRwiRu7d+xfz4F4unI6AUiXqDerzp\niSL42ZHRQEdjUMR0I8Q5DU/LuwhavFvWwB8AFBNkk+J5KtA+esDS7j5XkRA/lIC2\nzWTOumh7TSldk3sdl2rRSeWaQ3I4MGgOpADein4Q7oxhZ7grHYcgxG0y5baqhHeo\nofIDnzJk4X7y52k7WPeNRc5i