tskool-Psk","node_id":"U_kgDODSdKSg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Planetskool-Psk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Planetskool-Psk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Planetskool-Psk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Planetskool-Psk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Planetskool-Psk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Planetskool-Psk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kanji2001/new2/commits/eda97b7a475920154a7f3724c24c45084d04b678/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-19T19:53:33Z","email":"licences@planetskool.org","name":"Planetskool-Psk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-19T19:53:33Z","email":"licences@planetskool.org","name":"Planetskool-Psk"},"message":"Enhance Gantt chart functionality with time context and task bars\n\n- Introduced TimelineTimeContext for managing time-to-pixel conversions and absolute time authority.\n- Updated GanttGrid to utilize GanttTaskBars for rendering task bars based on visible tasks and current time.\n- Added a test task in dummyData for easier testing of bar positioning.\n- Implemented time unit determination based on cell width for accurate rendering.\n- Refactored GanttPage to integrate TimelineTimeProvider, ensuring synchronization of timeline and Gantt grid.","tree":{"sha":"9107f342875392f8461345fcea45c6b4650a7dad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kanji2001/new2/git/trees/9107f342875392f8461345fcea45c6b4650a7dad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kanji2001/new2/git/commits/eda97b7a475920154a7f3724c24c45084d04b678","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220678730?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Planetskool-Psk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"ht