,"subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/talmdal/tessera/commits/5742d00f3de9f4e8ee59bcac1d34abd2aaab703e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T03:38:29Z","email":"talmdal@outlook.com","name":"talmdal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T03:38:29Z","email":"talmdal@outlook.com","name":"talmdal"},"message":"feat: ledger balance display, account-type coloring, and status editing\n\n- AccountManager: fix GetBalanceAsync to query ledger table (was using\n  old transactions table with wrong schema)\n- AccountsPlugin: pass portfolio preferences to AccountsWidget\n- AccountViewModel: BalanceBrush is now value-aware per account type;\n  liability accounts (CreditCard/Loan/Liability) show green when <= 0,\n  red when > 0; normal accounts reversed\n- AccountsTab: pass preferences to LedgerView.LoadAccount calls\n- AccountsWidget: refresh on every tab activation via\n  OnAttachedToVisualTree; respect show-available preference when\n  computing displayed balance\n- LedgerEntryViewModel: add balanceOffset and accountType; split\n  PaymentText/DepositText into LeftColumnText/RightColumnText with\n  liability-aware sign logic; add IsGoodBalance/IsBadBalance for CSS\n  class binding\n- LedgerView.axaml: balance summary strip with Show Available toggle\n  (blue when checked via ToggleButton.Resources override); DataGrid\n  balance column colored via CSS classes; left/right columns with\n  fixed IndianRed/SeaGreen foreground; status combo with ItemTemplate\n  (full text in dropdown) and SelectionBoxItemTemplate (short letter\n  in closed box); form grid widened for Status combo column\n- LedgerView.axaml.cs: LoadAccount accepts preferences; show-available\n  toggle persisted per portfolio; balance offset applied per entry;\n  account-type-aware column headers (Charge/Payment vs Payment/Deposit);\n  Status combo with GetSelectedStatus(); FillForm restores status;\n  StatusOption record for abbreviated selection display","tree":{"sha":"7dbea4562df8d93eb8eac2403126c261af05ad0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/talmdal/tessera/git/trees/7dbea4562df8d93eb8eac2403126c261af05ad0d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/talmdal/tessera/git/commits/5742d00f3de9f4e8ee59bcac1d34abd2aaab703e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87743?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/talmdal","id":87743,"login":"talmdal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NzQz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/talmdal/tessera/commit/5742d00f3de9f4e8ee59bcac1d34abd2aaab703e","node_id":"C_kwDOQr1DStoAKDU3NDJkMDBmM2RlOWY0ZThlZTU5YmNhYzFkMzRhYmQyYWFhYjcwM2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/talmdal/tessera/commit/11e71715b84c08c6e60bfdfe6321f6d326f95282","sha":"11e71715b84c08c6e60bfdfe6321f6d326f95282","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/talmdal/tessera/commits/11e71715b84c08c6e60bfdfe6321f6d326f95282"}],"sha":"5742d00f3de9f4e8ee59bcac1d34abd2aaab703e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/talmdal/tessera/commits/5742d00f3de9f4e8ee59bcac1d34a