mdal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/talmdal/tessera/commits/0be7220b43f919c3269e3c870e676c0c23dcf2f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T05:55:06Z","email":"talmdal@outlook.com","name":"talmdal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T05:55:06Z","email":"talmdal@outlook.com","name":"talmdal"},"message":"feat(accounts): full CRUD UI with dialogs, context menu, and domain model updates\n\n- Fix AccountType enum to explicit 1-based values (Bank=1..Liability=7) matching account_types seed\n- Add MinimumBalance to Account record, AccountCreationOptions, and AccountUpdateOptions\n- Add IsClosed? to AccountUpdateOptions for toggling closed state via UpdateAccountAsync\n- Add GetInstitutionNamesAsync() to IAccountManager; implement in AccountManager\n- Wire minimum_balance and is_closed through all AccountManager SQL (SELECT/INSERT/UPDATE)\n- Pass default currency preference from AccountsPlugin to AccountsTab\n- Update AccountViewModel: new TypeLabels, RowOpacity and NameDecoration for closed accounts\n- Add AddAccountDialog: name, type, currency, opening/minimum balance, CalendarDatePicker,\n  institution AutoCompleteBox (filtered, opens on focus), account number\n- Add EditAccountDialog: same editable fields plus IsHidden/IsClosed checkboxes;\n  institution autocomplete pre-populated from DB\n- Rewrite AccountsTab: Filters flyout (Active/Hidden/Closed checkboxes), right-click\n  context menu (Account Details, Hide/Show, Close/Reopen, Delete with dynamic headers),\n  right panel replaced with ledger placeholder for future use","tree":{"sha":"ac1b2e90a58d4d0e011d9a8b82be8822aa9862de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/talmdal/tessera/git/trees/ac1b2e90a58d4d0e011d9a8b82be8822aa9862de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/talmdal/tessera/git/commits/0be7220b43f919c3269e3c870e676c0c23dcf2f3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsign