mdal/tessera/commits/12780c91b8c90cac928098430793633700d94328/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T02:48:15Z","email":"talmdal@outlook.com","name":"talmdal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T02:48:15Z","email":"talmdal@outlook.com","name":"talmdal"},"message":"Adds database explorer plugin and account schema migration\n\nIntroduces a built-in developer plugin for exploring SQLite tables in the open portfolio, featuring a dedicated UI for table browsing and DDL viewing. Migrates account storage to use normalized foreign keys for account types, currencies, and financial institutions, with supporting schema migrations and data seeding. Also adds a default currency preference for new accounts and ensures plugin registry interface is properly provided.\n\nEnhances extensibility, improves data integrity, and streamlines developer diagnostics.","tree":{"sha":"33fc38764d2d119738b01e14752475eeb081f038","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/talmdal/tessera/git/trees/33fc38764d2d119738b01e14752475eeb081f038"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/talmdal/tessera/git/commits/12780c91b8c90cac928098430793633700d94328","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87743?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/talmdal","id":87743,"login":"talmdal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NzQz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/talmdal/tessera/commit/12780c91b8c90cac928098430793633700d94328","node_id":"C_kwDOQr1DStoAKDEyNzgwYzkxYjhjOTBjYWM5MjgwOTg0MzA3OTM2MzM3MDBkOTQzMjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/talmdal/tessera/commit/95008755d6cc376d847aa9cac36443db8ff6c17a","sha":"95008755d6cc376d847aa9cac36443db8ff6c17a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/talmdal/tessera/commits/95008755d6cc376d847aa9cac36443db8ff6c17a"}],"sha":"12780c91b8c90cac928098430793633700d94328","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/talmdal/tessera/commits/12780c91b8c90cac928098430793633700d94328"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87743?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/talmdal","id":87743,"login":"talmdal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NzQz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/talmdal/tessera/commits/95008755d6cc376d847aa9cac36443db8ff6c17a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T04:49:56Z","email":"talmdal@outlook.com","name":"talmdal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T18:58:19Z","email":"talmdal@outlook.com","name":"talmdal"},"message":"feat: add Account Manager plugin\n\nIntroduces IAccountManager and wires it into the portfolio-scoped\nplugin system, following the same patterns as IPortfolioManager.\n\nAPI (Tessera.Api):\n- Account/IAccountManager.cs — CRUD interface: GetAccountsAsync,\n  GetBalanceAsync, CreateAccountAsync, UpdateAccountAsync,\n  CloseAccountAsync, DeleteAccountAsync\n- Account/AccountEvents.cs — cancellable pre-action events\n  (AccountCreatingEvent, AccountUpdatingEvent, AccountClosingEvent,\n  AccountDeletingEvent) and post-action events\n- Data/IDatabaseAccess.cs — add Query<T> for row-mapping queries\n- Plugin/IPluginContext.cs — expose IAccountManager Accounts\n\nImplementation (Tessera.App):\n- Account/AccountManager.cs — Dapper/SQLite implementation; fires\n  events via IEventBus; balance falls back to opening balance until\n  the transactions table is introduced in Phase 2\n- Plugin/AccountsPlugin.cs — IsEssential built-in plugin; registers\n  the Accounts tab (Order=10) and Accounts menu\n- Plugin/AccountsMigrationProvider.cs — v1 migration creates the\n  accounts table (id, name, type, currency_code, opening_balance,\n  opened_on, institution_name, account_number, is_hidden, is_closed)\n- DI/AppModule.cs — register IAccountManager singleton\n- Plugin/AppPluginContext.cs — thread IAccountManager through context\n- TesseraApplication.cs — register AccountsPlugin as built-in\n\nUI (Tessera.App):\n- UI/Portfolio/AccountsTab.axaml + .cs — two-pane MS Money-style tab:\n  account list with balances on the left, detail card on the right\n- UI/Portfolio/AccountViewModel.cs — thin view model for list display\n\nTesting:\n- Tessera.Testing/PluginTestHarness.cs — add Query<T> to\n  InMemoryDatabaseAccess; expose IAccountManager stub on\n  StubPluginContext","tree":{"sha":"15accb9777ccd0be53ae712cb30e4b609992de6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/talmdal/tessera/git/trees/15accb9777ccd0be53ae712cb30e4b609992de6d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/