/tessera/commits/367ed21e8a2f8e83fd0aa11085b788cdf02f1ccb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-24T23:25:38Z","email":"talmdal@outlook.com","name":"talmdal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-24T23:25:38Z","email":"talmdal@outlook.com","name":"talmdal"},"message":"fix: File>Exit always last (Order-only sort) + F4 key binding to exit\n\n- MenuManager: sort items by Order only; Group used solely for separator\n  placement — fixes ''file.exit'' sorting before ''file.portfolio'' (e < p)\n- MainWindow: F4 KeyBinding bound to ExitCommand via DataContext\n- RelayCommand: minimal ICommand wrapper for parameterless actions\n- MainWindow sets DataContext = this so AXAML bindings resolve against\n  the window''s own properties","tree":{"sha":"f7fb5a42352316e0092d33d93facf4780e178d75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/talmdal/tessera/git/trees/f7fb5a42352316e0092d33d93facf4780e178d75"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/talmdal/tessera/git/commits/367ed21e8a2f8e83fd0aa11085b788cdf02f1ccb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87743?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/talmdal","id":87743,"login":"talmdal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NzQz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/talmdal/tessera/commit/367ed21e8a2f8e83fd0aa11085b788cdf02f1ccb","node_id":"C_kwDOQr1DStoAKDM2N2VkMjFlOGEyZjhlODNmZDBhYTExMDg1Yjc4OGNkZjAyZjFjY2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/talmdal/tessera/commit/f8c53864a34169107065256000ff5a7509d7767c","sha":"f8c53864a34169107065256000ff5a7509d7767c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/talmdal/tessera/commits/f8c53864a34169107065256000ff5a7509d7767c"}],"sha":"367ed21e8a2f8e83fd0aa11085b788cdf02f1ccb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/talmdal/tessera/commits/367ed21e8a2f8e83fd0aa11085b788cdf02f1ccb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87743?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/talmdal","id":87743,"login":"talmdal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NzQz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/talmdal/tessera/commits/f8c53864a34169107065256000ff5a7509d7767c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-24T23:21:07Z","email":"talmdal@outlook.com","name":"talmdal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-24T23:21:07Z","email":"talmdal@outlook.com","name":"talmdal"},"message":"feat: bootstrap store + portfolio lifecycle manager\n\nBootstrap store (Tier 1 — pre-database config):\n- IBootstrapStore: LastPortfolioPath, RecentPortfolios (max 10), AppVersion\n- RegistryBootstrapStore: HKCU\\Software\\Tessera (Windows)\n- JsonBootstrapStore: %APPDATA%/Tessera/bootstrap.json (non-Windows)\n- BootstrapStoreFactory: picks implementation at runtime via OperatingSystem.IsWindows()\n\nPortfolio lifecycle (Tier 2 — per-portfolio SQLite):\n- IPortfolioManager / PortfolioSession / PortfolioInfo in Tessera.Api\n- One SQLite file per portfolio; metadata table stores name, encrypted flag, created_at\n- TesseraPortfolioManager: Create/Open/Close; owns SqliteDatabaseAccess lifecycle\n- Publishes PortfolioOpenedEvent / PortfolioClosedEvent to notify plugins\n\nApplication wiring:\n- IPluginContext.Database and .Preferences now delegate through IPortfolioManager;\n  throw InvalidOperationException if no portfolio is open\n- IPluginContext gains .Portfolios property\n- AppModule: removed hardcoded SqliteDatabaseAccess singleton; added IBootstrapStore\n  and IPortfolioManager\n- TesseraApplication: auto-opens LastPortfolioPath on startup; adds\n  File > New Portfolio, Open Portfolio, Close Portfolio menu items\n- PluginTestHarness: InMemoryPortfolioManager auto-opens a test session so\n  Database/Preferences work without extra setup in tests","tree":{"sha":"55f4c1a4a2837de87524f488a5fdbb5c3d89ffa2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/talmdal/tessera/git/trees/55f4c1a4a2837de87524f488a5fdbb5c3d89ffa2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/talmdal/tessera/git/commits/f8c53864a34169107065256000ff5a7509d7767c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87743?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/gists{/gist_id}","gr