ser","url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/talmdal/tessera/commits/d2f4fd17547ffdd549e083fc3bf8aefd2c5fef33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-24T22:54:05Z","email":"talmdal@outlook.com","name":"talmdal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-24T22:54:05Z","email":"talmdal@outlook.com","name":"talmdal"},"message":"feat: add File>Exit menu item and graceful shutdown via ShutdownCoordinator\n\n- ShutdownCoordinator publishes ApplicationShuttingDownEvent, calls\n  ShutdownAll() on all plugins, then calls lifetime.Shutdown()\n- File > Exit registered as core menu item (Order: MaxValue, always last\n  in the File menu) before plugins are initialised\n- MainWindow.OnClosing intercepts both the X button and any programmatic\n  close request, delegates to ShutdownCoordinator; interlocked guard\n  prevents re-entrant shutdown on the second Closing callback\n- Removed old ShutdownRequested handler (coordinator owns full lifecycle)","tree":{"sha":"399f8d18c568d32604d67286bc3c93273b42ced7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/talmdal/tessera/git/trees/399f8d18c568d32604d67286bc3c93273b42ced7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/talmdal/tessera/git/commits/d2f4fd17547ffdd549e083fc3bf8aefd2c5fef33","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87743?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/talmdal","id":87743,"login":"talmdal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NzQz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/talmdal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tal