s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atulmahankal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atulmahankal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atulmahankal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atulmahankal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atulmahankal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahankals/ClaudeCode_generated_app/commits/df813c187ee4323cddd80cd1ba935dac539eacc1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-20T16:24:18Z","email":"atulmahankal@gmail.com","name":"Atul Mahankal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-20T16:24:18Z","email":"atulmahankal@gmail.com","name":"Atul Mahankal"},"message":"Initial commit: JAM stack application with microservices architecture\n\nImplemented full-stack application with:\n- Frontend: Next.js 16 with React 19, TanStack Query, shadcn/ui components\n- Backend: gRPC microservices (auth, todos, fundflow)\n- Database: PostgreSQL with custom database engine abstraction\n- Gateway: Kong API gateway for routing\n- Authentication: JWT-based auth with sessions and 2FA support\n- Todos: Full CRUD with lists, priorities, due dates\n- Fundflow: Transaction tracking with categories and recurring support\n\nFeatures:\n- User authentication (login/signup) with bug fixes\n- Todo lists management with priority levels\n- Financial transaction tracking with income/expense categorization\n- Responsive dashboard with sidebar navigation\n- Real-time data updates via React Query\n- Docker Compose orchestration for all services\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e82172c78432c9820fc360334cebb154d60ff6eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahankals/ClaudeCode_generated_app/git/trees/e82172c78432c9820fc360334cebb154d60ff6eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahankals/ClaudeCode_g