ould change the API key, potentially causing denial of service or accessing unauthorized external resources.\n🔧 Fix: Explicitly set `permission_classes = (IsAdminUser,)` in `SettingsViewSet`.\n✅ Verification:\n- Added `backend/tests/security/test_settings_permissions.py` (403 assertions).\n- Updated existing settings tests to use `admin_client`.\n- Fixed CI `setup-pixi` manifest path.\n- Fixed Frontend ESLint project configuration.\n\nCo-authored-by: ollieb89 <37653836+ollieb89@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"3f9c4d58b069da23ffb41716d8fc3ec3512566a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ollieb89/jules_api_ui/git/trees/3f9c4d58b069da23ffb41716d8fc3ec3512566a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ollieb89/jules_api_ui/git/commits/8afbd7b34413893c14549809b98309854a70398c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ollieb89/jules_api_ui/commit/8afbd7b34413893c14549809b98309854a70398c","node_id":"C_kwDOQsHgKdoAKDhhZmJkN2IzNDQxMzg5M2MxNDU0OTgwOWI5ODMwOTg1NGE3MDM5OGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ollieb89/jules_api_ui/commit/2118b81744061e300be2e70166027916cb7069db","sha":"2118b81744061e300be2e70166027916cb7069db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ollieb89/jules_api_ui/commits/2118b81744061e300be2e70166027916cb7069db"}],"sha":"8afbd7b34413893c14549809b98309854a70398c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ollieb89/jules_api_ui/commits/8afbd7b34413893c14549809b98309854a70398c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ollieb89/jules_api_ui/commits/2118b81744061e300be2e70166027916cb7069db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-18T20:09:31Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-18T20:09:31Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"🛡️ Sentinel: Fix Authorization Bypass and CI Workflow Paths\n\n🚨 Severity: CRITICAL\n💡 Vulnerability: The `SettingsViewSet` inherited the default `IsAuthenticated` permission, allowing any authenticated user to read and update the system-wide API key.\n🎯 Impact: Regular users could change the API key, potentially causing denial of service or accessing unauthorized external resources.\n🔧 Fix: Explicitly set `permission_classes = (IsAdminUser,)` in `SettingsViewSet` to restrict access to staff/admin users only.\n✅ Verification:\n- Added `backend/tests/security/test_settings_permissions.py` to assert 403 Forbidden for regular users.\n- Updated existing `SettingsViewSet` tests to use `admin_client`.\n- Fixed `ci.yml` working directories to point to correct `frontend/` and `backend/` paths.\n\nCo-authored-by: ollieb89 <37653836+ollieb89@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"552899a1d3db97d122ee8ad5ff2bd9a9e5b12ea4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ollieb89/jules_api_ui/git/trees/552899a1d3db97d122ee8ad5ff2bd9a9e5b12ea4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ollieb89/jules_api_ui/git/commits/2118b81744061e300be2e70166027916cb7069db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/go