%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ollieb89/jules_api_ui/commits/dbb58a7eea23e324deda5869bf87f5ecca9ead88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-18T19:49:48Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-18T19:49:48Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"Refactor user list buttons to semantic anchor links\n\nReplaces `button` elements with `router.navigate()` handlers with semantic `a` tags using `routerLink` in the UserListComponent. This improves accessibility and usability by enabling native browser behaviors like \"Open in new tab\" and displaying the target URL on hover.\n\nChanges:\n- Replaced \"Add User\" and \"Add First User\" buttons with `routerLink=\"/users/new\"`.\n- Replaced \"Edit\" buttons with `[routerLink]=\"[''/users'', user.id, ''edit'']\"`.\n- Removed unused `createUser` and `editUser` methods and `Router` injection from `UserListComponent`.\n- Updated unit tests to verify `href` attributes instead of spying on `router.navigate`.\n- Preserved existing visual styling using utility classes.","tree":{"sha":"5582b4abfc7e9d1609555808230a45588367a54d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ollieb89/jules_api_ui/git/trees/5582b4abfc7e9d1609555808230a45588367a54d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ollieb89/jules_api_ui/git/commits/dbb58a7eea23e324deda5869bf87f5ecca9ead88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_