eac58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabrielebaglioni/studio/commits/a7fd6ec059414a7b2a3d6a5aa123a3c3edaeac58"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97400054?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gabrielebaglioni","id":97400054,"login":"gabrielebaglioni","node_id":"U_kgDOBc409g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabrielebaglioni/studio/commits/c46595dc8a1f65484c6dc15f9ee3da21564c241f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-25T16:57:47Z","email":"gabrielebaglioni55@gmail.com","name":"gabrielebaglioni"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-25T16:57:47Z","email":"gabrielebaglioni55@gmail.com","name":"gabrielebaglioni"},"message":"refactor: migrate from assetPrefix to basePath for microfrontends routing\n\n- Replace assetPrefix with basePath in Next.js config for details and checkout apps\n  - Fixes chunk loading errors in gateway mode\n  - Aligns with Turborepo microfrontends best practices\n  - basePath only active in development (gateway mode)\n\n- Reorganize route structure to match basePath configuration\n  - Move routes from app/projects/ to app/ in details app\n  - Move routes from app/support/ to app/ in checkout app\n  - Next.js automatically adds /projects or /support prefix via basePath\n\n- Update all internal route references\n  - Remove /projects and /support prefixes from internal links\n  - Use relative paths (/) for same-app navigation in standalone mode\n  - Use CrossAppLink with full paths for cross-app navigation\n\n- Fix CrossAppLink component for proper routing\n  - Use native <a> tag for cross-app links in gateway mode to avoid basePath conflicts\n  - Use Next.js Link for same-app relative links\n  - Properly handle port switching in standalone mode\n\n- Remove projects listing page\n  - No standalone /projects or /support pages\n  - All navigation goes directly to project-specific pages\n\n- Update route helper functions\n  - getDetailsHref() and getSupportHref() now handle gateway vs standalone correctly\n  - Same-app navigation in standalone uses relative paths without prefix\n  - Cross-app navigation uses full URLs with correct prefixes\n\n- Update all components to use correct link types\n  - Header/footer components use Link for same-app, CrossAppLink for cross-app\n  - All internal API routes updated to use relative paths\n  - Success/cancel pages use CrossAppLink for navigation\n\nThis refactoring resolves:\n- Chunk loading errors (double /_next/ paths)\n- Incorrect URL generation in standalone mode\n- basePath conflicts when navigating between apps\n- CSS and asset loading issues in gateway mode","tree":{"sha":"30fe81b621391e1aad7249ab09aea8cc6f691a7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabrielebaglioni/studio/git/trees/30fe81b621391e1aad7249ab09aea8cc6f691a7f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabrielebaglioni/studio/git/commits/c46595dc8a1f65484c6dc15f9ee3da21564c241f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97400054?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/ev