vents","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gabrielebaglioni/studio/commit/e4fc7f2a8fbd2030a645b652f9b69f36c29c0407","node_id":"C_kwDOQsSxmNoAKGU0ZmM3ZjJhOGZiZDIwMzBhNjQ1YjY1MmY5YjY5ZjM2YzI5YzA0MDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gabrielebaglioni/studio/commit/e07202f1a92e2c334b391ac21b4d6798e2c4b74c","sha":"e07202f1a92e2c334b391ac21b4d6798e2c4b74c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabrielebaglioni/studio/commits/e07202f1a92e2c334b391ac21b4d6798e2c4b74c"}],"sha":"e4fc7f2a8fbd2030a645b652f9b69f36c29c0407","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabrielebaglioni/studio/commits/e4fc7f2a8fbd2030a645b652f9b69f36c29c0407"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97400054?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gabrielebaglioni","id":97400054,"login":"gabrielebaglioni","node_id":"U_kgDOBc409g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabrielebaglioni/studio/commits/e07202f1a92e2c334b391ac21b4d6798e2c4b74c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-23T20:43:54Z","email":"gabrielebaglioni55@gmail.com","name":"gabrielebaglioni"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-23T20:43:54Z","email":"gabrielebaglioni55@gmail.com","name":"gabrielebaglioni"},"message":"feat: migrate to PNPM workspaces and configure microfrontends gateway proxy\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: Complete migration from NPM to PNPM\n\n## Package Manager Migration (NPM → PNPM)\n\n- Remove all package-lock.json files\n- Add pnpm-workspace.yaml for monorepo workspace configuration\n- Update root package.json to use pnpm@9.15.0 as package manager\n- Replace all workspace dependencies with ''workspace:*'' protocol\n- Update .gitignore to exclude npm/yarn lock files and track pnpm-lock.yaml\n- Remove npm references from engines and packageManager fields\n\n## Microfrontends Gateway Proxy Configuration\n\n- Configure Turborepo microfrontends proxy for unified development gateway\n- Add microfrontends.json in apps/shell with routing configuration:\n  - Shell: port 3000, default route (/)\n  - Details: port 3001, routes /projects/*\n  - Checkout: port 3002, routes /support/*\n  - Gateway proxy: port 3024\n- Add development fallback URLs for remote apps\n- Remove custom proxy-server.js (replaced by Turborepo proxy)\n\n## Development Mode Routing\n\n- Implement dual development modes: Gateway and Standalone\n- Add route helpers in packages/utils/routes.ts:\n  - getDetailsHref() and getSupportHref() with mode detection\n  - Support for relative links (gateway) and absolute links (standalone)\n  - Environment variable configuration (NEXT_PUBLIC_DEV_MODE)\n- Add DevModeHint component for development mode indicator\n- Update README-DEV.md with comprehensive gateway vs standalone documentation\n\n## CSS Isolation and Asset Loading Fixes\n\n- Add data-mfe attributes to remote app layouts for CSS scoping\n- Implement CSS isolation rules in details/checkout globals.css:\n  - Image container isolation with !important rules\n  - Container and relative wrapper isolation\n  - Prevent shell CSS interference in gateway mode\n- Configure assetPrefix and rewrites in next.config.ts:\n  - Details: assetPrefix ''/projects'' in dev, rewrites for _next/*\n  - Checkout: assetPrefix ''/support'' in dev, rewrites for _next/*\n  - Ensures static assets load correctly through gateway proxy\n- Add @tailwind base and @tailwind components to remote apps\n- Disable preflight in remote apps to avoid conflicts with shell CSS\n\n## Design Improvements\n\n- Enhance project details page with modern Tailwind styling:\n  - Improved gradients and shadows\n  - Hover effects and transitions\n  - Better typography with gradient text\n  - Enhanced impact metrics cards\n- Enhance checkout/support page with improved UI:\n  - Better card designs with gradients\n  - Improved button states and hover effects\n  - Enhanced payment method selection\n  - Better visual hierarchy\n\n## Documentation Updates\n\n- Update README.md with PNPM commands and setup\n- Add comprehensive README-DEV.md with gateway/standalone modes\n- Update tech-research.md with:\n  - PNPM workspace decision\n  - CSS isolation strategy\n  - Asset loading solution\n  - Gateway proxy configuration\n\n## Configuration Files\n\n- Add pnpm-workspace.yaml for workspace definition\n- Update turbo.json (already configured for microfrontends)\n- Update all app next.config.ts files with assetPrefix configuration\n- Update tailwind.config.ts in remote apps (preflight: false)\n\nAll changes maintain backward compatibility and work seamlessly in both\ngateway mode (port 3024) and standalone mode (ports 3000/3001/3002).","tree":{"sha":"85dcb5aae7d08221a8c38809785345a35feba6f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabrielebaglioni/studio/git/trees/85dcb5aae7d08221a8c38809785345a35feba6f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabrielebaglioni/studio/git/commits/e07202f1a92e2c334b391ac21b4d6798e2c4b74c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97400054?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gabrielebaglioni","id":97400054,"login":"gabrielebaglioni","node_id":"U_kgDOBc409g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gabrielebaglioni/studio/commit/e07202f1a92e2c334b391ac21b4d6798e2c4b74c","node_id":"C_kwDOQsSxmNoAKGUwNzIwMmYxYTkyZTJjMzM0YjM5MWFjMjFiNGQ2Nzk4ZTJjNGI3NGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gabrielebaglioni/studio/commit/e91ff8ac7dc15d6146982cddd3365380e68c4cee","sha":"e91ff8ac7dc15d6146982cddd3365380e68c4cee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabrielebaglioni/studio/commits/e91ff8ac7dc15d6146982cddd3365380e68c4cee"}],"sha":"e07202f1a92e2c334b391ac21b4d6798e2c4b74c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabrielebaglioni/studio/commits/e07202f1a92e2c334b391ac21b4d6798e2c4b74c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97400054?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabrielebaglioni/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https: