ni55@gmail.com","name":"gabrielebaglioni"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-21T13:02:13Z","email":"gabrielebaglioni55@gmail.com","name":"gabrielebaglioni"},"message":"feat: major update - Next.js optimization, smooth scroll, and parallax improvements\n\n✨ Features:\n- Implement Apple trackpad-like smooth scroll for both mouse and trackpad\n- Add momentum scrolling with natural deceleration\n- Optimize parallax effects with Intersection Observer and performance improvements\n\n🔧 Dependencies & Cleanup:\n- Update Next.js to 15.5.9 and React to 19.2.1\n- Remove 26 unused dependencies (58% reduction)\n- Add lru-cache for sequence caching\n- Update all dependencies to latest stable versions\n- Remove unused genkit scripts and dependencies\n\n⚡ Performance Optimizations:\n- Add Intersection Observer for viewport detection (reduces calculations)\n- Implement RAF throttling for smooth scroll animations\n- Optimize Tailwind config with better content paths\n- Add GPU acceleration for parallax containers\n- Improve canvas rendering performance\n\n🎨 UI/UX Improvements:\n- Smooth scroll provider with adaptive input detection\n- Dynamic easing based on scroll velocity\n- Better parallax effect fluidity across all input devices\n- Enhanced scroll behavior matching Apple trackpad feel\n\n📝 Code Quality:\n- Enable TypeScript and ESLint checks in production\n- Update Next.js config with best practices\n- Add comprehensive comments and documentation\n- Improve code organization and maintainability\n\n🔨 Technical Details:\n- Custom smooth scroll hook with momentum physics\n- Trackpad vs mouse detection and adaptive smoothing\n- RequestAnimationFrame-based animations\n- Passive event listeners for better performance","tree":{"sha":"84e6b19b1e74757e20e977f1c62e26ead1d00bc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabrielebaglioni/studio/git/trees/84e6b19b1e74757e20e977f1c62e26ead1d00bc5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabrielebaglioni/studio/git/commits/615fea0a6527fb155