il":"huangguanhao@youloft.com","name":"Gavenr"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T21:14:26.963Z","repositoryId":1120357490,"sha":"45e86d2e1bb28474f14d8a6d7f6d763e85d73231"},{"author":{"account":null,"email":"huangguanhao@youloft.com","name":"Gavenr"},"authoredDate":"2025-12-10T09:34:29Z","committedDate":"2025-12-10T09:34:29Z","committer":{"account":null,"email":"huangguanhao@youloft.com","name":"Gavenr"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T21:14:26.963Z","repositoryId":1120357490,"sha":"c0a3766ef1b1dbb9828ece35403d33193097cc37"},{"author":{"account":null,"email":"huangguanhao@youloft.com","name":"Even Huang"},"authoredDate":"2025-12-10T09:26:05Z","committedDate":"2025-12-10T09:26:05Z","committer":{"account":null,"email":"huangguanhao@youloft.com","name":"Even Huang"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T21:14:26.963Z","repositoryId":1120357490,"sha":"17c33f26c2efed894484cb749aceb98d1f29a4ff"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T21:14:26.963Z","raw":[{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlyWorlds/interview/commits/80f330e340a0c4674545fcf74c61c39a77f01068/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-18T09:23:51Z","email":"huangguanhao@youloft.com","name":"Gavenr"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-18T09:23:51Z","email":"huangguanhao@youloft.com","name":"Gavenr"},"message":"docs: 新增前端面试高频算法题精选\n\n新增内容:\n- 排序算法: 快速排序、冒泡排序、归并排序（含多种实现方式）\n- 数组操作: 数组去重、扁平化、两数之和、最大子数组和\n- 字符串: 字符串反转、回文判断、最长公共前缀\n- 链表: 反转链表、合并有序链表、检测链表环\n- 二叉树: 最大深度、层序遍历、翻转二叉树\n- 动态规划: 爬楼梯、打家劫舍\n- 前端特有: 防抖节流、深拷贝、柯里化、LRU缓存、Promise实现\n\n特点:\n- 精选前端面试最常考的算法题\n- 每题提供多种解法和详细注释\n- 标注难度等级和面试要点\n- 包含复杂度分析和优化思路\n- 提供完整的测试用例\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"83d93c9b2feb481bcd25b1674e5eda0dd1304aba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlyWorlds/interview/git/trees/83d93c9b2feb481bcd25b1674e5eda0dd1304aba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlyWorlds/interview/git/commits/80f330e340a0c4674545fcf74c61c39a77f01068","