tis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-template/commits/7b5ab974c88d3824fccc23791c65eb0318e2cc6b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T11:06:00Z","email":"125390342+k8-benetis@users.noreply.github.com","name":"k8"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T11:06:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: migrate template to defineModule v2 (module-kit 0.6.0) (#2)\n\n* feat: migrate template to defineModule v2 (module-kit 0.6.0)\n\nReflects the canonical pattern documented after Fase A.2.\n\nFrontend:\n- New src/Module.tsx as the single declarative source — defineModule({...})\n  with id, displayName, accent, route, navigation, slots, api, requiredRoles,\n  requiredPlan, and data (CSP-of-data allowlist).\n- src/moduleEntry.ts deleted — entry is auto-generated by @nekazari/module-builder.\n- manifest.json deleted — emitted into dist/manifest.json at build time.\n- vite.config.ts simplified to a single defineConfig(nkzModulePreset({...}))\n  call; moduleId is read from package.json#nkz.moduleId.\n- src/main.tsx now wraps the dev shell in MockProvider for `pnpm dev`.\n- src/App.tsx becomes the production main page (rendered at the module''s\n  route), consuming useAuth + useI18n.\n- src/slots/index.ts simplified to the {id, component, priority?} shape;\n  module-kit handles the SlotWidgetDefinition translation internally.\n- ExampleSlot.tsx switched to @nekazari/module-kit hooks (useAuth, useI18n).\n\nDependencies bumped:\n- @nekazari/module-kit ^0.6.0  (new)\n- @nekazari/module-builder ^1.2.0\n- @nekazari/sdk ^1.1.0\n- @nekazari/ui-kit ^1.0.2-alpha.4\n- @tanstack/react-query ^5.59.0  (peer of module-kit)\n\nREADME rewritten to document the new declarative API + hook surface.\n\n* fix: drop obsolete module-slots type re-export (types live in module-kit now)\n\n* ci: disable build-module + build-backend jobs in the template (placeholder ids fail nkzModulePreset)","tree":{"sha":"9a98633c16dd4a072599ff3e289c187ace8cba8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-template/git/trees/9a98633c16dd4a072599ff3e289c187ace8cba8d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-template/git/commits/7b5ab974c88d3824fccc23791c65eb0318e2cc6b","verification":{"payload":"tree 9a98633c16dd4a072599ff3e289c187ace8cba8d\nparent 8d2372c9e0762e689a48f0ed05f8a5042e81de0a\nauthor k8 <125390342+k8-benetis@users.noreply.github.com> 1778756760 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778756760 +0200\n\nfeat: migrate template to defineModule v2 (module-kit 0.6.0) (#2)\n\n* feat: migrate template to defineModule v2 (module-kit 0.6.0)\n\nReflects the canonical pattern documented after Fase A.2.\n\nFrontend:\n- New src/Module.tsx as the single declarative source — defineModule({...})\n  with id, displayName, accent, route, navigation, slots, api, requiredRoles,\n  requiredPlan, and data (CSP-of-data allowlist).\n- src/moduleEntry.ts deleted — entry is auto-generated by @nekazari/module-builder.\n- manifest.json deleted — emitted into dist/manifest.json at build time.\n- vite.config.ts simplified to a single defineConfig(nkzModulePreset({...}))\n  call; moduleId is read from package.json#nkz.moduleId.\n- src/main.tsx now wraps the dev shell in MockProvider for `pnpm dev`.\n- src/App.tsx becomes the production main page (rendered at the module''s\n  route), consuming useAuth + useI18n.\n- src/slots/index.ts simplified to the {id, component, priority?} shape;\n  module-kit handles the SlotWidgetDefinition translation internally.\n- ExampleSlot.tsx switched to @nekazari/module-kit hooks (useAuth, useI18n).\n\nDependencies bumped:\n- @nekazari/module-kit ^0.6.0  (new)\n- @nekazari/module-builder ^1.2.0\n- @nekazari/sdk ^1.1.0\n- @nekazari/ui-kit ^1.0.2-alpha.4\n- @tanstack/react-query ^5.59.0  (peer of module-kit)\n\nREADME rewritten to document the new declarative API + hook surface.\n\n* fix: drop obsolete module-slots type re-export (types live in module-kit now)\n\n* ci: disable build-module + build-backend jobs in the template (placeholder ids fail nkzModulePreset)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqBayYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAaYMQAJfYUYty0kFciIwIPnPxJZ/e\nXttNydKuE6/C846A1xSJlqBKJQS2ggPzQatWAoReWM9Te85nAPixqQaGXnTn9WI5\nKd9hi6mYgMjTmVN2d61M704yUS/QEpHovbVNkDujilERl+IKFH8cnlgrCt8H8GZP\nmxA2Nz2AgoxQadVMSxYLQQWMU4m0L9xSstTB9BH6PFmmwUnRF2jDPn4zFR5VUBim\ng5QuUeVx+mcOxHdJs2GWvqzEkH99MB1/oC0zNog2eMtto/fkohZN7EOP+eyhZp0w\nyC8QA6UHqhwFbfkr2ZrF7KKd1WEN7b5tAVmQGKT0OVtm9vhecayebckWUmWJ2Ff4\nyuIisBhOxlnOROkNiS2ioy79G22/aDkGioME1BXZTYEmCuHGEN/hjTeUpRKUrOXj\n2QliCOTn88MyqI52gYGmwMDfC5cobEbl/ZJq5DX9CcFFkKZlqCcKnF0rE9nGecUw\nn4PZu1ZIHcNHIHtSTXAtpFAd0GUYaJJwTHFawwecef2U/bLErIfRreEaQ4GKh8Xa\n+37w+KNm/+g6p3B6pW4fn7Eo8ix2ckFv2+VFcG0MA1MnVUBm9xstqn/81a45ZtZh\n51yyEhqnAE50aTkyNLSxojyywcZtEcLw6UN60LOgC2o3vLyBqMLZEYcfdtYh0cCL\nRxHbbkNbKBr1rWql0CDa\n=WGz/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-14T11:06:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api