 src/moduleEntry.ts: calls window.__NKZ__.register() at runtime\n- Add src/slots/index.ts: typed ModuleViewerSlots definition\n- Rewrite global.d.ts: window.__NKZ__, __NKZ_SDK__, __NKZ_UI__ host globals\n- Rewrite ExampleSlot: uses useViewer/useAuth directly, no console.log\n- Rewrite App.tsx: minimal dev shell (no federation export comment)\n- Remove src/hooks/useUIKit.tsx: old window.__nekazariUIKit pattern, not needed\n- Update package.json: remove federation dep, add build:module script\n- Update vite.config.ts: nkzModulePreset (classic JSX, correct externals, IIFE output)\n- Update tsconfig.json: jsx: react (classic runtime, not react-jsx)\n- Update registration.sql: remote_entry_url → /modules/MODULE_NAME/nkz-module.js\n- Delete k8s/frontend-deployment.yaml: IIFE modules don''t ship nginx containers\n- Update docker-compose.yml: remove frontend service, fix hardcoded domain\n- Update CI workflow: build IIFE bundle + artifact instead of frontend Docker image\n- Add manifest.json with build_config: {type: iife}\n- Add README.md and rewrite SETUP.md with IIFE workflow docs\n- Fix backend config: cors_origins default [] (not [\"*\"]), remove artotxiki.com","tree":{"sha":"d02c757d057de7165c11290c1489f3010435a079","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-template/git/trees/d02c757d057de7165c11290c1489f3010435a079"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-template/git/commits/69dd95081d0c1333e4c31de3d9e03940fb99b9f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125390342?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/k8-ben