e/commits/a63ef7ef9e6836f8b7dca1074f283a100fb072f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T00:59:57Z","email":"kani.anwari@gmail.com","name":"Kanishkah Anwari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T00:59:57Z","email":"kani.anwari@gmail.com","name":"Kanishkah Anwari"},"message":"feat: Python Data Transform Layer via pydantic-monty\n\nAdds a secure, LLM-powered data transformation step so integrators can\npush raw datasets and describe what to compute in plain English — Spark\ngenerates Python code, executes it in the Monty sandbox (no I/O, no\nnetwork, microsecond startup), and caches the result in the Data Bridge.\n\n- backend/requirements.txt: add pydantic-monty>=0.1.0\n- app/services/transform.py: TransformService with LLM code gen\n  (temperature=0.1, stdlib-only prompt) + Monty sandboxed execution\n  (5s timeout, 10MB input limit, JSON-serializable output validation)\n- app/routers/transform.py: three endpoints —\n    POST /api/components/{id}/data/transform  (generate + cache)\n    POST /api/transform/preview               (generate, no cache)\n    GET  /api/components/{id}/data/transform/code\n- app/main.py: register transform router at /api prefix\n- Playground.tsx: add \"Transform\" tab with raw JSON input,\n  transform description textarea, and side-by-side code/output view\n- SparkClient.ts: transformData(), previewTransform(), getTransformCode()\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fd14e07b950a956f4f3db59b6accad3d54ec9b25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anwarika/spark-engine/git/trees/fd14e07b950a956f4f3db59b6accad3d54ec9b25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anwarika/spark-engine/git/commits/a63ef7ef9e6836f8b7dca1074f283a100fb072f9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38044808?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/events{/privacy}",