,"message":"Fix widget/dashboard prompt issues found during 3-mode testing\n\n- Widget: forbid outer page wrapper (bg-base-200/min-h-screen), add explicit\n  kpi_monthly guidance (for MRR/ARR trend, NEVER use metrics[])\n- Widget: add dataLabels:disabled and tooltip.y.formatter to chart example\n- Dashboard: add correct data fetch pattern with __COMPONENT_ID/__DATA_MODE\n- Dashboard: add SYNTHETIC DATA RULE — for observability/ops metrics not in\n  any profile (latency, error rate, SLOs), generate hardcoded JS arrays\n  instead of fetching, to avoid infinite loading spinners\n- Cache: bump to v5 to invalidate all stale cached responses\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"88f4578981b69ffce402e7eb811f71fa3c569b0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anwarika/spark-engine/git/trees/88f4578981b69ffce402e7eb811f71fa3c569b0e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anwarika/spark-engine/git/commits/e9f09c4176cabfb863772cf6eef27aaf20717869","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38044808?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anwarika","id":38044808,"login":"anwarika","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MDQ0ODA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anwarika/spark-engine/commit/e9f09c4176cabfb863772cf6eef27aaf20717869","node_id":"C_kwDOQsrd-toAKGU5ZjA5YzQxNzZjYWJmYjg2Mzc3MmNmNmVlZjI3YWFmMjA3MTc4Njk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anwarika/spark-engine/commit/4ebbd51cd9a089752efdbc680789b59448209ae9","sha":"4ebbd51cd9a089752efdbc680789b59448209ae9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anwarika/spark-engine/commits/4ebbd51cd9a089752efdbc680789b59448209ae9"}],"sha":"e9f09c4176cabfb863772cf6eef27aaf20717869","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anwarika/spark-engine/commits/e9f09c4176cabfb863772cf6eef27aaf20717869"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38044808?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anwarika","id":38044808,"login":"anwarika","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MDQ0ODA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anwarika/spark-engine/commits/4ebbd51cd9a089752efdbc680789b59448209ae9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T01:25:16Z","email":"kani.anwari@gmail.com","name":"Kanishkah Anwari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T01:25:16Z","email":"kani.anwari@gmail.com","name":"Kanishkah Anwari"},"message":"chore: stop tracking __pycache__, tighten Python gitignore","tree":{"sha":"f3e8b448cf11594522cc2a7f936ac3c2cd5d20b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anwarika/spark-engine/git/trees/f3e8b448cf11594522cc2a7f936ac3c2cd5d20b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anwarika/spark-engine/git/commits/4ebbd51cd9a089752efdbc680789b59448209ae9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38044808?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anwarika","id":38044808,"login":"anwarika","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MDQ0ODA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anwarika/spark-engine/commit/4ebbd51cd9a089752efdbc680789b59448209ae9","node_id":"C_kwDOQsrd-toAKDRlYmJkNTFjZDlhMDg5NzUyZWZkYmM2ODA3ODliNTk0NDgyMDlhZTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anwarika/spark-engine/commit/eb947c72d176b3a52028f0f11efecce7d77825cb","sha":"eb947c72d176b3a52028f0f11efecce7d77825cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anwarika/spark-engine/commits/eb947c72d176b3a52028f0f11efecce7d77825cb"}],"sha":"4ebbd51cd9a089752efdbc680789b59448209ae9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anwarika/spark-engine/commits/4ebbd51cd9a089752efdbc680789b59448209ae9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38044808?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anwarika","id":38044808,"login":"anwarika","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MDQ0ODA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anwarika/spark-engine/commits/eb947c72d176b3a52028f0f11efecce7d77825cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T01:22:46Z","email":"kani.anwari@gmail.com","name":"Kanishkah Anwari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T01:22:46Z","email":"kani.anwari@gmail.com","name":"Kanishkah Anwari"},"message":"feat: 3-mode generation (dashboard/widget/quick) + data field fixes\n\n## Generation modes\nThree distinct system prompts now route based on intent:\n- dashboard: full-page multi-chart layout (Tableau/Looker quality)\n  triggers on: dashboard, analytics, overview, observability, etc.\n- widget: single embeddable card (Grafana panel / Linear insight quality)\n  targets 60-120 lines, 200-240px chart height, no page wrapper\n- quick: ephemeral inline chat render (ChatGPT data analyst quality)\n  targets 30-60 lines, table or mini-bar, instant readable answer\n\nChatMessage.mode field (''dashboard''|''widget''|''quick''|null) lets callers\noverride; null falls back to keyword auto-detection in _detect_mode().\nChatResponse.meta dict carries resolved_mode back to frontend for\niframe sizing decisions.\n\n## Data field fixes\n- MRR trend charts: use kpi_monthly (reliable monthly mrr/net_new_mrr)\n  NOT metrics.mrr (daily, often 0 or sparse in saas profile)\n- Waterfall: use kpi_monthly.net_new_mrr, churn_rate, mrr — all reliable\n- Data field guidance added to system prompt for saas profile\n\n## Number formatting\n- fmtMoney/fmtNum helpers defined in system prompt and multi-chart example\n- Rule: NEVER show raw integers — always format (e.g. $104M not 104658761)\n- Applied to all yaxis.labels.formatter in examples\n\n## iframe alias fix\n- window.__COMPONENT_ID and window.__DATA_MODE set as back-compat aliases\n  in iframe template (were undefined, causing /api/components/undefined/data)\n- window.__DATA_MODE kept in sync when data bridge mode changes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1600982aea0983e58351c8a99ce4dc9e88c509ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anwarika/spark-engine/git/trees/1600982aea0983e58351c8a99ce4dc9e88c509ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anwarika/spark-engine/git/commits/eb947c72d176b3a52028f0f11efecce7d77825cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38044808?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anwarika","id":38044808,"login":"anwarika","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MDQ0ODA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/repos","site_admi