ri@gmail.com","name":"Kanishkah Anwari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T01:01:42Z","email":"kani.anwari@gmail.com","name":"Kanishkah Anwari"},"message":"feat: upgrade LLM system prompt for rich Tableau-quality dashboards\n\n- Add DASHBOARD DESIGN SYSTEM: consistent color palette (indigo/cyan/amber/\n  emerald/red), typography scale, card layout rules, CSS grid patterns\n- Add CHART TYPE SELECTION GUIDE: which ApexCharts type to use for each\n  data shape (area gradients, stacked bar, donut, heatmap, funnel, sparkline)\n- Fix APEXCHARTS USAGE: swap createEffect → onMount for chart init; charts\n  no longer render into null refs. Add destroy-on-cleanup rule.\n- Add RICH DASHBOARD TRIGGER: when prompt contains dashboard/analytics/\n  observability/health/metrics/intelligence, always generate multi-chart\n  layout with KPI row + 3-5 chart panels\n- Replace simple line chart example with correct onMount area chart pattern\n- Add full multi-chart dashboard example (KPI cards + MRR area + ARR\n  stacked bar + plan donut + activity heatmap) for LLM to pattern-match\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a66debdd5d6684a948bfb995473b3ea74d6d3e1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anwarika/spark-engine/git/trees/a66debdd5d6684a948bfb995473b3ea74d6d3e1d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anwarika/spark-engine/git/commits/ec85dc5a8929ac769f391bba3199964636c1c0a8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38044808?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anwarika","id":38044808,"login":"anwarika","nod