d sparkline KPI cards\n- Platform Observability: p50/p95/p99 latency area chart with SLO\n  annotation, service health table with live status dots, 7×24 error\n  rate heatmap with colour scale, request volume and stacked error\n  breakdown charts\n- Product Analytics: DAU/WAU/MAU multi-series with 7-day moving avg,\n  cohort retention heatmap with % labels, acquisition donut, activation\n  funnel with drop-off rates\n\nAll rendered with ApexCharts — interactive tooltips, smooth animations,\ndark theme, responsive grid layouts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a78d5a54e942fd1467f2203cb6a02c41847ba5dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anwarika/spark-engine/git/trees/a78d5a54e942fd1467f2203cb6a02c41847ba5dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anwarika/spark-engine/git/commits/1807f570814314785e33fd71c584238db356f49e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38044808?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anwarika","id":38044808,"login":"anwarika","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MDQ0ODA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anwarika","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anwarika/spark-engine/commit/1807f57081431