":"2026-10-01T09:42:06Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T09:42:06Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"message":"fix: Give each shared bundle its own cache folder\n\nSeparate bundles build in parallel into one cache directory. Since #141 the\nchunk rename deletes the file esbuild wrote, so two bundles that split out the\nsame module raced over one file name and the second failed with ENOENT (#154).\nThe same sharing let clear() of one bundle delete a chunk another bundle''s\nmetadata still listed.\n\nEach bundle now writes its artifacts to <cachePath>/<bundle>[-dev]/, next to\nits <bundle>[-dev].meta.json; clear() removes that folder. A .nf-cache.json\nstamp records the layout and builder version; when it is missing or the layout\nor major.minor differs, the project cache folder is purged before any bundle\nruns, which also clears caches written in the old layout.\n\nThe side-by-side regression test is adapted from #155 by denatys.\n\nFixes #154","tree":{"sha":"a63f91fa59d9de987e4b20fce95f4d9850c6e75d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/trees/a63f91fa59d9de987e4b20fce95f4d9850c6e75d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/commits/8741f523589ee6ef8572d11914840d021a0ce81b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url"