_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/312838770288c8e9bacf51f605fdfb4899adcd81/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T06:16:37Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T06:16:37Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"message":"feat: let a shared mapping ask for a bundle of its own\n\nMappings shared one build, so `build` had nothing to select and was warned about and dropped.\nNow that they build apart from the exposed modules they can be planned like shared externals:\n''separate'' gives a mapping its own bundle, ''package'' one bundle per mapped package so the\nexpansions of a wildcard mapping stay together, and anything unannotated stays in the default\n''mapping-bundle''. Each mapping carries its bundle''s name in `bundle`, so the orchestrator\nregisters that bundle''s chunks for whichever remote serves it.\n\n`platform`, `chunks` and `packageInfo` still have nothing to select and still warn.","tree":{"sha":"804a8b8af9ed50ffdb1dd7aa7079ee9699e4868e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/trees/804a8b8af9ed50ffdb1dd7aa7079ee9699e4868e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/commits/312838770288c8e9bacf51f605fdfb4899adcd81","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/native-federation-core/commit/312838770288c8e9bacf51f605fdfb4899adcd81","node_id":"C_kwDOQtD_rtoAKDMxMjgzODc3MDI4OGM4ZTliYWNmNTFmNjA1ZmRmYjQ4OTlhZGNkODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/native-federation-core/commit/f5ba0e1eec1e03ff8bd241d95627dc11c7952e7f","sha":"f5ba0e1eec1e03ff8bd241d95627dc11c7952e7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/f5ba0e1eec1e03ff8bd241d95627dc11c7952e7f"}],"sha":"312838770288c8e9bacf51f605fdfb4899adcd81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/312838770288c8e9bacf51f605fdfb4899adcd81"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/f5ba0e1eec1e03ff8bd241d95627dc11c7952e7f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T06:09:34Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T06:09:34Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"message":"docs: describe what a chunk name is and is not","tree":{"sha":"cb43bff9a4b967141a388b6d9598bc83557bcadd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/trees/cb43bff9a4b967141a388b6d9598bc83557bcadd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/commits/f5ba0e1eec1e03ff8bd241d95627dc11c7952e7f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/native-federation-core/commit/f5ba0e1eec1e03ff8bd241d95627dc11c7952e7f","node_id":"C_kwDOQtD_rtoAKGY1YmEwZTFlZWMxZTAzZmY4YmQyNDFkOTU2MjdkYzExYzc5NTJlN2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/native-federation-core/commit/a0c1c3c281ddebe6d1ce4d04e82f9037065ec46f","sha":"a0c1c3c281ddebe6d1ce4d04e82f9037065ec46f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/a0c1c3c281ddebe6d1ce4d04e82f9037065ec46f"}],"sha":"f5ba0e1eec1e03ff8bd241d95627dc11c7952e7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/f5ba0e1eec1e03ff8bd241d95627dc11c7952e7f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/a0c1c3c281ddebe6d1ce4d04e82f9037065ec46f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T13:25:33Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T06:09:34Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"message":"fix: build shared mappings separately from exposed modules\n\nOne esbuild run covered both, so the bundler could factor a chunk out of a shared mapping\nand an exposed module together. The mapping resolves through the import map and may be\nserved by another remote; the exposed module always resolves inside the remote that built\nit. One set of bytes then arrives through two import trails, as two module records, and\nanything with identity in that chunk exists twice — an InjectionToken provided through one\ncopy and injected through the other is the NG0201 this produces.\n\nTwo builds cannot share a chunk, so the two are now built apart. The exposed build keeps the\nname ''mapping-or-exposed'', which the orchestrator registers for every remote it knows;\nmapping chunks are published under ''mapping-bundle'' and each mapping carries that name in\nits `bundle` field, the way a shared external already does.\n\nBoth builds write into one directory, and a chunk name is the bundler''s to choose. A real\nbundler hashes the chunk''s output bytes, so one name there means one set of bytes, but each\nbuild''s chunks are renamed before the next runs so the arrangement does not rest on that.","tree":{"sha":"34c2470954c3d855582bfb4374f90472340aa515","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/trees/34c2470954c3d855582bfb4374f90472340aa515"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/commits/a0c1c3c281ddebe6d1ce4d04e82f9037065ec46f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/native-federation-core/commit/a0c1c3c281ddebe6d1ce4d04e82f9037065ec46f","node_id":"C_kwDOQtD_rtoAKGEwYzFjM2MyODFkZGViZTZkMWNlNGQwNGU4MmY5MDM3MDY1ZWM0NmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/native-federation-core/commit/f965f076c0af8882aabf9b96bdb79514f6796121","sha":"f965f076c0af8882aabf9b96bdb79514f6796121","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/f965f076c0af8882aabf9b96bdb79514f6796121"}],"sha":"a0c1c3c281ddebe6d1ce4d04e82f9037065ec46f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/a0c1c3c281ddebe6d1ce4d04e82f9037065ec46f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/f965f076c0af8882aabf9b96bdb79514f6796121/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T13:19:42Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T13:19:42Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"message":"fix: do not hoist a bundler chunk on its name alone\n\nWithout denseChunking a chunk is published as a SharedInfo, which the orchestrator resolves\nby version with first-writer-wins. As a singleton the file name was therefore the share key,\nwith nothing behind it: nothing compares the bytes between copies, so any way the naming is\nwrong resolves to the wrong file rather than to a missed optimisation.\n\nA chunk is also the wrong thing to share on. It belongs to a build, not to a dependency, so\nnothing downstream can tell whether the external it was split out of asked for\n`singleton: false` or a share scope, and a chunk carrying an InjectionToken or a\nroot-provided service would bleed state straight through those boundaries. Each remote\nloads its own copy again, as it did before 4.6.","tree":{"sha":"1ffc2105c46c1d15edf52a2b459a70b59a989734","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/trees/1ffc2105c46c1d15edf52a2b459a70b59a989734"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/commits/f965f076c0af8882aabf9b96bdb79514f6796121","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/native-federation-core/commit/f965f076c0af8882aabf9b96bdb79514f6796121","node_id":"C_kwDOQtD_rtoAKGY5NjVmMDc2YzBhZjg4ODJhYWJmOWI5NmJkYjc5NTE0ZjY3OTYxMjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/native-federation-core/commit/c26a4d13b91c7989532370e90d709f215919e96e","sha":"c26a4d13b91c7989532370e90d709f215919e96e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/c26a4d13b91c7989532370e90d709f215919e96e"}],"sha":"f965f076c0af8882aabf9b96bdb79514f6796121","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/f965f076c0af8882aabf9b96bdb79514f6796121"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/c26a4d13b91c7989532370e90d709f215919e96e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T13:18:50Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T13:18:50Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"message":"fix: always write a chunk hash in base32, and hash a cycle once\n\nThe slot the bundler wrote was read for both its length and its character set. Only the\nlength is needed: it keeps every reference at its byte length so the emitted source maps\nstay valid. Inferring the alphabet meant a Rollup-named chunk got a mixed-case name back,\nand two names differing only in case are one file on a case-insensitive filesystem, so the\nsecond chunk written overwrote the first — a collision the build-time name check cannot\nsee, because the names differ. Single-case base32 makes every name collision a real hash\ncollision, which throws.\n\nA cycle also hashed its whole joined unit once per member; it now hashes the unit once and\nnames each member after that digest and its position, the same result at O(bytes + n).","tree":{"sha":"8bed7b1c7a4846243b055a67b94b43a37bb46790","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/trees/8bed7b1c7a4846243b055a67b94b43a37bb46790"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/commits/c26a4d13b91c7989532370e90d709f215919e96e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_