rs","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denatys/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denatys/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/denatys","id":163468009,"login":"denatys","node_id":"U_kgDOCb5S6Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denatys/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denatys/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denatys/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denatys/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denatys/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denatys","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/77dfe1892530d8b5afe2f4b55c1df3a6593c52ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T12:20:25Z","email":"denis@fairmarkit.com","name":"Denis Atyasov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T12:20:25Z","email":"denis@fairmarkit.com","name":"Denis Atyasov"},"message":"fix: hash a chunk cycle as one unit and keep the slot rules honest\n\nA member of an import cycle was hashed while its partner still carried the bundler''s name,\nso its name was not a function of the bytes written and two applications could publish\ndifferent bytes under one name. A cycle is now a strongly connected component hashed as one\nunit, references inside it replaced by the member''s position. The hash segment must be at\nleast 8 characters and may contain `$`, as Rollup writes it; a file that is not a script is\nleft alone; two chunks with different bytes landing on one name is an error, not a silent\noverwrite.","tree":{"sha":"7abb02cc0815bdedb69ef523f1e7277f276ee8ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/trees/7abb02cc0815bdedb69ef523f1e7277f276ee8ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/commits