tps://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/native-federation-core/commit/ee91ded601e01ec8c25c24ae16f5919c636a65c3","node_id":"C_kwDOQtD_rtoAKGVlOTFkZWQ2MDFlMDFlYzhjMjVjMjRhZTE2ZjU5MTljNjM2YTY1YzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/native-federation-core/commit/cc172ea1ac1beb88a0a33286cf9fc9164047654d","sha":"cc172ea1ac1beb88a0a33286cf9fc9164047654d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/cc172ea1ac1beb88a0a33286cf9fc9164047654d"}],"sha":"ee91ded601e01ec8c25c24ae16f5919c636a65c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/ee91ded601e01ec8c25c24ae16f5919c636a65c3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163468009?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denatys/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denatys/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denatys/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denatys/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/denatys","id":163468009,"login":"denatys","node_id":"U_kgDOCb5S6Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denatys/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denatys/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denatys/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denatys/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denatys/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denatys","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/cc172ea1ac1beb88a0a33286cf9fc9164047654d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T07:07:15Z","email":"163468009+denatys@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Denis Atyasov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T07:07:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: keep the source map valid when rewriting chunk imports\n\ntransformChunkImports parsed every emitted bundle with TypeScript and printed the whole file again to turn ./chunk-x.js into @nf-internal/chunk-x, while the .js.map esbuild had written next to it stayed as written. Every shared package therefore shipped a map for a text that no longer existed.\r\n\r\nThe rewrite now finds the specifier literals with es-module-lexer, splices them into the original text and moves the generated columns of the map segments that follow an edit on the same line, the way angular-architects/module-federation-plugin#1128 did for the 21.x.x backport. Files without a chunk import are not written at all.","tree":{"sha":"e5c8a503b053ad79196c2d56cf6731d42cc40164","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/trees/e5c8a503b053ad79196c2d56cf6731d42cc40164"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/commits/cc172ea1ac1beb88a0a33286cf9fc9164047654d","verification":{"payload":"tree e5c8a503b053ad79196c2d56cf6731d42cc40164\nparent 379fa4830d5350904fe1beb13ace8d0ce8ea186f\nauthor Denis Atyasov <163468009+denatys@users.noreply.github.com> 1789801635 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789801635 +0200\n\nfix: keep the source map valid when rewriting chunk imports\n\ntransformChunkImports parsed every emitted bundle with TypeScript and printed the whole file again to turn ./chunk-x.js into @nf-internal/chunk-x, while the .js.map esbuild had written next to it stayed as written. Every shared package therefore shipped a map for a text that no longer existed.\r\n\r\nThe rewrite now finds the specifier literals with es-module-lexer, splices them into the original text and moves the generated columns of the map segments that follow an edit on the same line, the way angular-architects/module-federation-plugin#1128 did for the 21.x.x backport. Files without a chunk import are not written at all.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrjSjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAcEoQAKwCj7K9CeqLmhism80A0IEI\nJt/J6ICF3SUA5lUZiLwTEzZ4j7LtAG/Q5MvD70NA/9K7g9taLcO+blxlrbZCY7oJ\nkez26aN2CvTSS7bvhSZx8MDGNsFQgDWUPvGaBb9f+yocuizfrpTZGBh9ezPiUv5Q\no/X8h6BMNXr22QnAvnSrzDz+zWxhngnat+0W3Qyg7oFmu8qsR/9cYaNHiWXrXMk1\neLZsaynwmEfOpY6z0pY/rSksXo7fA4NWPaoveqcAw7ET7qcaUAivglFeZBVy7WAK\nW8+qsCLADtsCnZUTN0pUG/wkEOPz3o6i6d3EmuDF4QFqb0qb6QqR77eCEETT0sq4\nDjA9nIpyDx4gMrwxOA+RRGvFUNnsMohZlxOykoKIo73EvSUcIFmVvkBXF7LN7rLd\nOO7AJ6EMWJxkGgIF4kna5YewNmxPuYYikiGSAfZIpdPqgQEWSBkLH+aVI13vKzLc\ncu71nTTIKKE9oKioUSj7m1g0tM5SXcNGpPSz6zpxnMcIVUDyh2CbtGeq/pHY+1qe\ndOtxAYO5f0wQ31cE8+PJsCpP+BUhl9vMTItLdrkjcUUrCIVP7nTuOnAGz61PBVpw\n/TzsLpppnpQ2zQg3cfnslpTDBmpdmRfjIOm+jFQwrlqME/7LDocEk2+CNvbwHVPS\nQXticfLPKl7+w9lGcMib\n=0gmZ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-19T07:07:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github