lse,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/native-federation-core/commit/4e4137b22db8edfa12e2c6dc74e85f96e390d5e3","node_id":"C_kwDOQtD_rtoAKDRlNDEzN2IyMmRiOGVkZmExMmUyYzZkYzc0ZTg1Zjk2ZTM5MGQ1ZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/native-federation-core/commit/f867b8f16a339d81b3e25f30274daa6428ceae1b","sha":"f867b8f16a339d81b3e25f30274daa6428ceae1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/f867b8f16a339d81b3e25f30274daa6428ceae1b"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/native-federation-core/commit/923fc4768ceb995999caad2546faf460838fa81b","sha":"923fc4768ceb995999caad2546faf460838fa81b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/923fc4768ceb995999caad2546faf460838fa81b"}],"sha":"4e4137b22db8edfa12e2c6dc74e85f96e390d5e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/4e4137b22db8edfa12e2c6dc74e85f96e390d5e3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/923fc4768ceb995999caad2546faf460838fa81b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T07:56:03Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T07:56:03Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"message":"fix(config): close three gaps the range format opened\n\nRouting a mapping''s default through `applyAutoRequiredOptions` instead of\nconcatenating `''~'' + version` moved the default path behind a regex and a\n`typeof` check that do not handle three inputs the old code handled.\n\nThe single-token regex ended in `((?:[-+][\\w.]+)?)`. `\\w` excludes `-` and\nonly one `[-+]` segment was allowed, so `1.0.0-rc-1` and\n`1.0.0-beta.1+sha` did not match and fell through unformatted. For a\nmapping that silently dropped the `~` and emitted an exact pin, and with\n`strictVersion` defaulting to `mappingVersion: true` a host one prerelease\nahead then hard-fails negotiation that passed before. The tail is now\n`((?:-[\\w.-]+)?(?:\\+[\\w.-]+)?)`, which is what README already promised\n(''a prerelease tag is kept''). Fixing the regex rather than special-casing\nthe mapping default also closes the same hole on the shared path; the\npattern stays end-anchored, so a multi-comparator range still falls\nthrough.\n\n`typeof requiredVersionCfg === ''object''` is true for `null`, so a\n`requiredVersion: null` written in an untyped federation.config.js threw\non the property read -- `normalizeMappingConfig` only filters `undefined`,\nand the `??` it replaced treated `null` as nullish. The same expression\nshort-circuited `asked ?? mappingConfig.version ?? mappingVersion` on an\nempty string, discarding the detected version. Splitting it apart, the way\n`shareCore` already does, fixes both.\n\nREADME''s claim that `version: ''auto''` is the same as omitting it holds for\nmappings but not for the `share()` section it sits in: an explicit ''auto''\nsuppresses an adjacent `version` and forces a `lookupVersion` that throws\nwhen the package is not declared. Documented instead of changed -- the\nprecedence is not this branch''s to alter.\n\n`shareCore` reaches the same `typeof null === ''object''` crash at\nshare-utils.ts:212. It predates this branch, so it is left for its own\nchange.","tree":{"sha":"1229b34fb4c604be74429918c2b094bdbc2dee10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/trees/1229b34fb4c604be74429918c2b094bdbc2dee10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/commits/923fc4768ceb995999caad2546faf460838fa81b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/native-federation-core/commit/923fc4768ceb995999caad2546faf460838fa81b","node_id":"C_kwDOQtD_rtoAKDkyM2ZjNDc2OGNlYjk5NTk5OWNhYWQyNTQ2ZmFmNDYwODM4ZmE4MWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/native-federation-core/commit/cef56dafd842853a77e0617ea96f274c1ab537d6","sha":"cef56dafd842853a77e0617ea96f274c1ab537d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/cef56dafd842853a77e0617ea96f274c1ab537d6"}],"sha":"923fc4768ceb995999caad2546faf460838fa81b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/923fc4768ceb995999caad2546faf460838fa81b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/cef56dafd842853a77e0617ea96f274c1ab537d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T07:03:39Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T07:03:39Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"message":"feat(config): let a shared mapping pick its requiredVersion range\n\n#117 gave `share`/`shareAll` an object form of `requiredVersion`\n(`{ version?, range? }`) that formats the detected version as ''exact'',\n''^'', ''~'', ''minor'' or ''patch''. Mappings read their version the same way --\nfrom the mapped lib''s nearest package.json -- but `toSharedMappingInfo`\nhardcoded `''~'' + version`, so the only way to emit a `^` was to hardcode\nthe whole string, which then stops following the version. That is the\ngap faragos raised on #117 and it is what this closes.\n\n`ExternalConfigInput` names the widened shape once; the share options\nalias it and `SharedMappingEntry`/`SharedMappingConfigs` now use it.\n`NormalizedMappingConfig.requiredVersion` widens too: the version the\nobject formats is only read at build time, so it cannot be resolved\nduring normalization.\n\nPrecedence matches `shareCore`: the object''s `version` beats the config''s\n`version`, which beats the detected one, and it drives the emitted\n`version` field as well. `''auto''` means the same as omitting it. The\nformatting itself is `applyAutoRequiredOptions`, unchanged, so a\nmulti-comparator range still passes through untouched.\n\nA mapping keeps `~` as its default, including for an object that names no\n`range` -- an in-workspace lib is versioned in lockstep with nothing, so\nsemver refusing a breaking change between two builds is still the safest\nbet. That is the one place mappings differ from a shared package.\n\nTwo edge cases shift now that the default path normalizes instead of\nconcatenating: `version: ''1.2''` emits `~1.2.0` rather than `~1.2`, and a\n`version` the formatter cannot parse (''>=1.0.0 <2.0.0'') passes through\ninstead of becoming `~>=1.0.0 <2.0.0`.\n\nREADME documents the range option in the shared section, which #117 left\nundocumented, and the mappings section links to it.","tree":{"sha":"31ef09dfccec97125618610b48a944fbd08a3ff6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/trees/31ef09dfccec97125618610b48a944fbd08a3ff6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/commits/cef56dafd842853a77e0617ea96f274c1ab537d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/native-federation-core/commit/cef56dafd842853a77e0617ea96f274c1ab537d6","node_id":"C_kwDOQtD_rtoAKGNlZjU2ZGFmZDg0Mjg1M2E3N2UwNjE3ZWE5NmYyNzRjMWFiNTM3ZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/native-federation-core/commit/f867b8f16a339d81b3e25f30274daa6428ceae1b","sha":"f867b8f16a339d81b3e25f30274daa6428ceae1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/f867b8f16a339d81b3e25f30274daa6428ceae1b"}],"sha":"cef56dafd842853a77e0617ea96f274c1ab537d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/cef56dafd842853a77