ubscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/native-federation-core/commit/f867b8f16a339d81b3e25f30274daa6428ceae1b","node_id":"C_kwDOQtD_rtoAKGY4NjdiOGYxNmEzMzlkODFiM2UyNWYzMDI3NGRhYTY0MjhjZWFlMWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/native-federation-core/commit/6052ebad99c4bee616fa0cb5ead2829043f91932","sha":"6052ebad99c4bee616fa0cb5ead2829043f91932","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/6052ebad99c4bee616fa0cb5ead2829043f91932"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/native-federation-core/commit/182257042a9207a68cd53b2a11f84fcb6f3da627","sha":"182257042a9207a68cd53b2a11f84fcb6f3da627","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/182257042a9207a68cd53b2a11f84fcb6f3da627"}],"sha":"f867b8f16a339d81b3e25f30274daa6428ceae1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/f867b8f16a339d81b3e25f30274daa6428ceae1b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/182257042a9207a68cd53b2a11f84fcb6f3da627/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T06:51:45Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T06:51:45Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"message":"refactor(config): build the program directly instead of through a service\n\nA `LanguageService` exists for incremental reuse across edits, and both\nhalves of that were already disabled here: `getScriptVersion` is the\nconstant ''0'', so no file can report a change, and `useRoots`/`reset`\nnull the service out at every build boundary. dc62336 removed the\nversion counter -- the service''s only reason to exist -- but left the\nservice; this is the other half of that commit.\n\n`ts.createProgram` takes the roots and options as arguments, so four\nhost members go and four arrive, nine carry over untouched. It always\nreturns a program, which drops the optional chaining in `reaches` and a\nternary in `surface`, and it has no equivalent of the `getProgram()`\nalias-table re-walk, so that warning goes too.\n\n`setParentNodes` is passed to `createSourceFile` rather than relying on\nthe binder: `isTypeOnlyAlias` reads `d.parent.parent`.\n\nNet three lines, and the point is the deleted abstraction rather than\nthe count. Measured at 200 mappings x 5 files, median of three: 162ms\nagainst 172ms cold and 59ms against 69ms for 1000 warm hits, with the\n20k-miss column moving the other way -- misses never touch the program,\nso that is the noise floor for the rest.","tree":{"sha":"5058d9d2d7656a1ccd3cc5d48f3957f0f00f805c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/trees/5058d9d2d7656a1ccd3cc5d48f3957f0f00f805c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/commits/182257042a9207a68cd53b2a11f84fcb6f3da627","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/native-federation-core/commit/182257042a9207a68cd53b2a11f84fcb6f3da627","node_id":"C_kwDOQtD_rtoAKDE4MjI1NzA0MmE5MjA3YTY4Y2Q1M2IyYTExZjg0ZmNiNmYzZGE2Mjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/native-federation-core/commit/3ac8bb460d4267eca62d5abedb4debb4a0845763","sha":"3ac8bb460d4267eca62d5abedb4debb4a0845763","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/3ac8bb460d4267eca62d5abedb4debb4a0845763"}],"sha":"182257042a9207a68cd53b2a11f84fcb6f3da627","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/182257042a9207a68cd53b2a11f84fcb6f3da627"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/3ac8bb460d4267eca62d5abedb4debb4a0845763/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T06:26:41Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T06:26:41Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"message":"docs(config): drop three more comments the code already states\n\nContinues 23c0841. `mappingExportNames` being test-only is not something\na comment can enforce, \"built to be discarded\" overstated what happens\nwhen no call is in a mapping, and the note on the warning''s wording\nrestated the sentence above it.","tree":{"sha":"8224139b41581c5f1edb149a9a5123a858cde839","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/trees/8224139b41581c5f1edb149a9a5123a858cde839"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/commits/3ac8bb460d4267eca62d5abedb4debb4a0845763","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/native-federation-core/commit/3ac8bb460d4267eca62d5abedb4debb4a0845763","node_id":"C_kwDOQtD_rtoAKDNhYzhiYjQ2MGQ0MjY3ZWNhNjJkNWFiZWRiNGRlYmI0YTA4NDU3NjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/native-federation-core/commit/4bef63ff75d3f9978dc7744cadd71e6a49e52e37","sha":"4bef63ff75d3f9978dc7744cadd71e6a49e52e37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/4bef63ff75d3f9978dc7744cadd71e6a49e52e37"}],"sha":"3ac8bb460d4267eca62d5abedb4debb4a0845763","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/3ac8bb460d4267eca62d5abedb4debb4a0845763"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/4bef63ff75d3f9978dc7744cadd71e6a49e52e37/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T06:23:22Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T06:26:32Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"message":"refactor(config): name the star-export audit for what it reads\n\n`*` is overloaded in this codebase: `parseWildcard`, `matchesWildcard`,\n`toGlobPattern`, `isWildcardMapping` and the resolver''s own \"unexpanded\nwildcard mapping(s)\" warning all mean glob wildcards. `auditStars` reads\nlike it audits those, when it audits `export *` declarations.\n\nRename to `auditStarExports` and `StarExportAudit`. Internal only -- the\nspec references neither.","tree":{"sha":"df723a28a9c4e883e27ae095f2edeb459d2cd092","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/trees/df723a28a9c4e883e27ae095f2edeb459d2cd092"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/commits/4bef63ff75d3f9978dc7744cadd71e6a49e52e37","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/native-federation-core/commit/4bef63ff75d3f9978dc7744cadd71e6a49e52e37","node_id":"C_kwDOQtD_rtoAKDRiZWY2M2ZmNzVkM2Y5OTc4ZGM3NzQ0Y2FkZDcxZTZhNDllNTJlMzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/native-federation-core/commit/69b26934e760125e2b0592396c098c814206472a","sha":"69b26934e760125e2b0592396c098c814206472a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/69b26934e760125e2b0592396c098c814206472a"}],"sha":"4bef63ff75d3f9978dc7744cadd71e6a49e52e37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/4bef63ff75d3f9978dc7744cadd71e6a49e52e37"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/69b26934e760125e2b0592396c098c814206472a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T06:22:58Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T06:26:32Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"message":"fix(config): keep the entry point posix-spelled on Windows\n\n`toDiskCase` ends in `path.normalize`, which returns backslashes on\nWindows, while `target` comes back from `ts.resolveModuleName` and is\nalways forward-slash. `mapping.entryPoint === target` is the module''s\none raw string compare, so whenever the case correction actually fires\nthe exact-entry-point branch silently stopped matching -- and that\nbranch is the only thing that can rewrite a barrel whose surface cannot\nbe enumerated, such as one re-exporting a bare specifier.\n\nEverything else survives because it runs through `toPosix` or\n`isUnderDir`. Corrected here rather than in `toDiskCase`, which has\nother callers, and `path.dirname` preserves forward slashes on Windows\nso `m.dir` is unaffected.\n\nThe test pins the missing combination -- a mis-cased key and an import\nlanding on the entry point itself. It passes on either side of this\ncommit on a case-sensitive filesystem, since `path.normalize` only\nre-spells separators on Windows; disabling the exact branch does fail\nit, so it covers the branch. Only a windows-latest job guards the\nseparator itself, and there is none in this repo yet.","tree":{"sha":"3307356b50c35dc88bf984a250f1c21636c56d59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/trees/3307356b50c35dc88bf984a250f1c21636c56d59"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/commits/69b26934e760125e2b0592396c098c814206472a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/native-federation-core/commit/69b26934e760125e2b0592396c098c814206472a","node_id":"C_kwDOQtD_rtoAKDY5YjI2OTM0ZTc2MDEyNWUyYjA1OTIzOTZjMDk4YzgxNDIwNjQ3MmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/native-federation-core/commit/0340a7a08ce0b3b1b3bba44a4370a4193f46f564","sha":"0340a7a08ce0b3b1b3bba44a4370a4193f46f564","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/0340a7a08ce0b3b1b3bba44a4370a4193f46f564"}],"sha":"69b26934e760125e2b0592396c098c814206472a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/69b26934e760125e2b0592396c098c814206472a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/0340a7a08ce0b3b1b3bba44a4370a4193f46f564/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T06:22:06Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T06:26:32Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"message":"fix(config): merge nested star ambiguity instead of replacing it\n\nMerging a nested audit''s clashes overwrote any clash found locally for\nthe same name. With three stars where the middle one is itself ambiguous\nthe symbol tsc reports at the top level is dropped from the clash set,\nso the name survives into the surface although ES exports nothing under\nit -- another rewrite in the unsafe direction.\n\nCollapse both sites onto one `clash` helper, which joins rather than\nreplaces and shortens the local site. An inline union at the merge would\nbe a line shorter but aliases the child''s set into the parent.","tree":{"sha":"9756b380e51457007d3dff7e4641d011648ecd11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/trees/9756b380e51457007d3dff7e4641d011648ecd11"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/commits/0340a7a08ce0b3b1b3bba44a4370a4193f46f564","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/native-federation-core/commit/0340a7a08ce0b3b1b3bba44a4370a4193f46f564","node_id":"C_kwDOQtD_rtoAKDAzNDBhN2EwOGNlMGIzYjFiM2JiYTQ0YTQzNzBhNDE5M2Y0NmY1NjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/native-federation-core/commit/469e3228a74e16ae8d365bedbe8881d538de9139","sha":"469e3228a74e16ae8d365bedbe8881d538de9139","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/469e3228a74e16ae8d365bedbe8881d538de9139"}],"sha":"0340a7a08ce0b3b1b3bba44a4370a4193f46f564","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/0340a7a08ce0b3b1b3bba44a4370a4193f46f564"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/469e3228a74e16ae8d365bedbe8881d538de9139/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T06:21:13Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T06:26:32Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"message":"fix(config): decline a binding erased by a type-only hop\n\n`bindingOf` jumped to the end of the alias chain with `getAliasedSymbol`\nand `isTypeOnlyExport` only inspected export specifiers, so a type-only\nhop on the import side was invisible. A barrel spelling\n\n    import type { BadgeComponent } from ''./badge.component'';\n    export { BadgeComponent };\n\nwas recorded as publishing a value: the chain ends on the class, which\ncarries `SymbolFlags.Value`. tsc erases the import and the re-export\nthat depends on it, so the emitted barrel exports nothing under that\nname -- `tsc` emits `export {}` and `esbuild --bundle` emits no bytes at\nall -- and the rewrite left `i1.BadgeComponent` undefined at runtime.\nThat is the failure this test exists to prevent, and it turns a working\nbuild that merely duplicates the lib into one that crashes.\n\n`--verbatimModuleSyntax` rejects the shape with TS1448, but Angular\nworkspaces set `--isolatedModules`, which accepts it silently.\n\nWalk the chain with `getImmediateAliasedSymbol` instead, declining at\nthe first type-only hop. The clash comparison in `auditStars` needs no\nchange: two erased bindings both read `null` and compare equal, so they\nare correctly not a clash.","tree":{"sha":"4028d2d5214df426d22367f913f3a7a506df8ee1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/trees/4028d2d5214df426d22367f913f3a7a506df8ee1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/commits/469e3228a74e16ae8d365bedbe8881d538de9139","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred