"commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T18:11:05Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T18:11:05Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"message":"docs(config): drop comments the code already states\n\nThree cut outright -- the `paths` inversion the next three lines\nperform, the roots rationale `useRoots(entryPoints)` carries in its\nsignature, and a fast-path note on a guard that reads as one. The rest\ntrimmed to the half a reader cannot infer.","tree":{"sha":"bb5b98802e02e175440b52cd6dfcc81972645258","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/trees/bb5b98802e02e175440b52cd6dfcc81972645258"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/git/commits/23c08415aef5bde1c010769cb6e35c7549e39b27","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-federation/native-fede