ents{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-core/commits/7fad46ae79849325183a0e26b9ac5a46b393b2bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T11:17:14Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T11:17:14Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"message":"fix: Spell the supplied packageJson the way disk spells it too\n\npackageJson is the other externally-supplied path in FederationOptions,\nand folderOf() in resolve-shared-dirs and bundle-shared prefers it over\nworkspaceRoot. Correcting only the root therefore left the linked-dep\nwatch set and the shared-bundle content signals derived from the spelling\nthe root had just moved away from -- the same class of mismatch this\nbranch exists to remove, in the subsystem a caller opts into by passing\nthe flag.\n\nNothing compares the two, so this was a hole rather than a regression,\nbut it is one call at the funnel that already corrects the root.","tree":{"sha":"1a6b3691c303cc141c7cbbbdb1732a45b8081fea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/native-federation-co