arshkshirsagar2403@gmail.com","name":"Harsh Kshirsagar"},"message":"Add complete forgot password feature with OTP verification\n\nFrontend Changes:\n- Added forgot password link to login page with key icon\n- Created forgot-password component for email input\n- Created reset-password component for OTP and new password input\n- Added password confirmation validation\n- Updated routing to include forgot-password and reset-password pages\n- Styled components to match application theme\n\nBackend Changes (user-service):\n- Added forgotPassword() method to generate and send OTP via email\n- Added resetPassword() method to verify OTP and update password\n- Added /api/auth/forgot-password endpoint\n- Added /api/auth/reset-password endpoint\n- Added sendPasswordResetEmail() to EmailService\n- OTP expires after 10 minutes for security\n\nFeatures:\n- User clicks forgot password link on login page\n- Enters email to receive OTP\n- Receives 6-digit OTP code via email\n- Enters OTP and new password on reset page\n- Password successfully reset with confirmation\n- Full password recovery workflow implemented","tree":{"sha":"ca6103510850c1b1e75806de1f6305559d03fd87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HemaDesingu04/RevHub-Social-Media-Platform/git/trees/ca6103510850c1b1e75806de1f6305559d03fd87"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HemaDesingu04/RevHub-Social-Media-Platform/git/commits/2c0c29a692b358dd19780a8cd55a1a8ee502555f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110247040?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harsh3201/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harsh3201/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harsh3201/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harsh3201/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/harsh3201","id":110247040,"login":"harsh32